(2324023, 323205, 41802, '<td valign="top">He he great idea.  I love your creativity!</td>', 'He he great idea.  I love your creativity!', '2006-04-19 02:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324030, 322522, 6804, '<td valign="top">Great colors here!  The light is just a little harsh on the grill.  I might have defused it just a bit for this.  I like the tinge of rust and the grass on the bottom of the frame.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great colors here!  The light is just a little harsh on the grill.  I might have defused it just a bit for this.  I like the tinge of rust and the grass on the bottom of the frame.  Nice shot.', '2006-04-19 02:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324041, 323219, 6804, '<td valign="top">Wow! Stunning image.</td>', 'Wow! Stunning image.', '2006-04-19 02:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324088, 323044, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but IMO maybe a different angle without so much of the foreground taken up by the hay pile might have improved things.</td>', 'Nice try, but IMO maybe a different angle without so much of the foreground taken up by the hay pile might have improved things.', '2006-04-19 02:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324119, 322154, 51638, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but for me there isn''t enough contrast between the subject''s face and the stone background. The face gets lost a little. Perhaps having taken the shot from a slightly different angle so that the weathered stone was still in the shot but the face was against the darker background of the steps might have worked?</td>', 'A nice image, but for me there isn''t enough contrast between the subject''s face and the stone background. The face gets lost a little. Perhaps having taken the shot from a slightly different angle so that the weathered stone was still in the shot but the face was against the darker background of the steps might have worked?', '2006-04-19 02:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324142, 322918, 51638, '<td valign="top">To me the somewhat blown out grass and bike frame in the foreground detracts from the rest of the image.</td>', 'To me the somewhat blown out grass and bike frame in the foreground detracts from the rest of the image.', '2006-04-19 02:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324156, 323204, 51638, '<td valign="top">I find the second headstone/shadow in the foreground distracting, which is a shame because the main headstone looks great.</td>', 'I find the second headstone/shadow in the foreground distracting, which is a shame because the main headstone looks great.', '2006-04-19 02:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324169, 321010, 51638, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you intended the soft focus, but personally I''d have preferred to have found some part of the image nice and sharp.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you intended the soft focus, but personally I''d have preferred to have found some part of the image nice and sharp.', '2006-04-19 02:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324188, 322007, 51638, '<td valign="top">Technically and OK shot, but I''m afraid I just don''t find anything particularly interesting here to look at.</td>', 'Technically and OK shot, but I''m afraid I just don''t find anything particularly interesting here to look at.', '2006-04-19 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324196, 320906, 51638, '<td valign="top">Yep, works for me.</td>', 'Yep, works for me.', '2006-04-19 02:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324221, 322929, 6804, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a great shot.  I like the soft color and the perspective you decided to shoot it from.  Beautiful crisp detail and natural placement of buckets and other elements to keep this unstaged.   10</td>', 'Wow! This is a great shot.  I like the soft color and the perspective you decided to shoot it from.  Beautiful crisp detail and natural placement of buckets and other elements to keep this unstaged.   10', '2006-04-19 02:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324241, 322473, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but quite a lot of detail lost in the highlights.</td>', 'nice shot, but quite a lot of detail lost in the highlights.', '2006-04-19 03:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324243, 322773, 44242, '<td valign="top">really like the composition, but i find the saturation too much in the sky.</td>', 'really like the composition, but i find the saturation too much in the sky.', '2006-04-19 03:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324246, 322821, 55394, '<td valign="top">ewww that reminds me of an old school science project... 8 from me good luck</td>', 'ewww that reminds me of an old school science project... 8 from me good luck', '2006-04-19 03:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324248, 322214, 44242, '<td valign="top">i like the composition and the abstract lines, but can''t lock onto any detail / sharpness.</td>', 'i like the composition and the abstract lines, but can''t lock onto any detail / sharpness.', '2006-04-19 03:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324251, 322787, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice idea... like the subect a lot. a closer view would have helped to isolate a subject.</td>', 'nice idea... like the subect a lot. a closer view would have helped to isolate a subject.', '2006-04-19 03:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324254, 322220, 44242, '<td valign="top">really nice color! like the contrast.</td>', 'really nice color! like the contrast.', '2006-04-19 03:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324256, 321776, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is great!<br/>I like the muted colors.  The soft light from the window in a shot like this, is very difficult to hold detail as well as you have managed here.  Impressive work.   10</td>', 'This is great!I like the muted colors.  The soft light from the window in a shot like this, is very difficult to hold detail as well as you have managed here.  Impressive work.   10', '2006-04-19 03:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324259, 320595, 6804, '<td valign="top">This it my kind of shot!  I really like everything about this.  The color is natural and not pushed.  I like the blown out detail in the window.  I find it difficult to incorporate that technique into a photograph and still maintain aesthetic quality at this level.  I''m a big fan of old rusty broken junk and wooden planks.  I like a photo that can strategically break the rules and defy the usual principals of composition.  Excellent in every way!  10</td>', 'This it my kind of shot!  I really like everything about this.  The color is natural and not pushed.  I like the blown out detail in the window.  I find it difficult to incorporate that technique into a photograph and still maintain aesthetic quality at this level.  I''m a big fan of old rusty broken junk and wooden planks.  I like a photo that can strategically break the rules and defy the usual principals of composition.  Excellent in every way!  10', '2006-04-19 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324260, 321680, 6804, '<td valign="top">:)<br/> <br/>Way cool! I like this just as it is.  I would love to see version #2 with a little grit and rust.  Still a strong 10.</td>', ':) Way cool! I like this just as it is.  I would love to see version #2 with a little grit and rust.  Still a strong 10.', '2006-04-19 03:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324262, 321680, 47294, '<td valign="top">Just fantastic, I took a similar composition photo of an old truck but this just makes it look plain!  10 from me and a fav.!</td>', 'Just fantastic, I took a similar composition photo of an old truck but this just makes it look plain!  10 from me and a fav.!', '2006-04-19 03:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324266, 321329, 56672, '<td valign="top">I love the depth on this photo...</td>', 'I love the depth on this photo...', '2006-04-19 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324267, 320858, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a maginficent ageing elephant.....He is just perfect.....</td>', 'What a maginficent ageing elephant.....He is just perfect.....', '2006-04-19 03:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324270, 322359, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice warmth and composition.</td>', 'nice warmth and composition.', '2006-04-19 03:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324271, 323062, 56672, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but it doesn''t strike the "old" chord for me.</td>', 'I like the photo, but it doesn''t strike the "old" chord for me.', '2006-04-19 03:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324275, 320888, 44242, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic! Like the composition and broodiness of the shot.</td>', 'Very dramatic! Like the composition and broodiness of the shot.', '2006-04-19 03:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324279, 321273, 56672, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been better with better light; the camera loses some feel in the darkness.</td>', 'I think this could have been better with better light; the camera loses some feel in the darkness.', '2006-04-19 03:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324287, 323205, 48228, '<td valign="top">Is it, yes, I think it is, I think I know the style and the composition well enough to beleive I know who it is..... Another great image here. Simple, but also very refreshing.....My only concerns is the wine glasses, as they definately don''t look old, but still a great image all the same.</td>', 'Is it, yes, I think it is, I think I know the style and the composition well enough to beleive I know who it is..... Another great image here. Simple, but also very refreshing.....My only concerns is the wine glasses, as they definately don''t look old, but still a great image all the same.', '2006-04-19 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324291, 321211, 48228, '<td valign="top">Way over the top, doesn''t feel old, but actually very modern in it approach, even though the scull is old. Again, the "fluro" colors also make it feel modern, and again not old. This is a shame, as this is a great photo, but to me doesn''t fit the challenge, re the modern approach/techniques used.....</td>', 'Way over the top, doesn''t feel old, but actually very modern in it approach, even though the scull is old. Again, the "fluro" colors also make it feel modern, and again not old. This is a shame, as this is a great photo, but to me doesn''t fit the challenge, re the modern approach/techniques used.....', '2006-04-19 03:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324292, 322797, 44242, '<td valign="top">i think you need to get right in there and make something the center of attention.</td>', 'i think you need to get right in there and make something the center of attention.', '2006-04-19 03:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324294, 321719, 48228, '<td valign="top">Great photo, and I have seen quite a few birds like this in my time.....This would have been so great for "texture challenge.....I love it.....</td>', 'Great photo, and I have seen quite a few birds like this in my time.....This would have been so great for "texture challenge.....I love it.....', '2006-04-19 03:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324295, 322772, 44242, '<td valign="top">this is very nice. like the sharpness on teh leaf and softness of the surrounding water. only minor critisism is the blown highlights. they help to frame the subject, but are also a little distracting. nicely done.</td>', 'this is very nice. like the sharpness on teh leaf and softness of the surrounding water. only minor critisism is the blown highlights. they help to frame the subject, but are also a little distracting. nicely done.', '2006-04-19 03:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324299, 321887, 44242, '<td valign="top">great color and exposure. i think it would have been better closer in without the foreground.</td>', 'great color and exposure. i think it would have been better closer in without the foreground.', '2006-04-19 03:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324300, 321301, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really like this, as it has the same feel about it, as the image that one a ribbon in the toy challenge.....magic shot.....</td>', 'I really like this, as it has the same feel about it, as the image that one a ribbon in the toy challenge.....magic shot.....', '2006-04-19 03:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324301, 322920, 48228, '<td valign="top">Similar to what I was thinking about, and you have taken this at its best moment..... Great colors and reflection.....</td>', 'Similar to what I was thinking about, and you have taken this at its best moment..... Great colors and reflection.....', '2006-04-19 03:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324305, 321115, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the technique you have used in this great old timer..... It suits this challenge so well and is a great image.....It almost has a ghostlike appearance.....</td>', 'I love the technique you have used in this great old timer..... It suits this challenge so well and is a great image.....It almost has a ghostlike appearance.....', '2006-04-19 03:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
