(2324350, 322447, 6912, '<td valign="top">BEING A RUSSIAN i CANNOT STAND ALL THOSE SPELLING MISTAKES :)good photo though</td>', 'BEING A RUSSIAN i CANNOT STAND ALL THOSE SPELLING MISTAKES :)good photo though', '2006-04-19 03:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324360, 320595, 117, '<td valign="top">I think if the whites where not all white. Like the details. Not sure but darken the image and then lighten up the dark spots with a a gray layer painting with the white brush or dodging. You could also combine two exposer of this image and paint with the history brush there is several ways to do it. Check with the rules on advanced.</td>', 'I think if the whites where not all white. Like the details. Not sure but darken the image and then lighten up the dark spots with a a gray layer painting with the white brush or dodging. You could also combine two exposer of this image and paint with the history brush there is several ways to do it. Check with the rules on advanced.', '2006-04-19 04:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324389, 321926, 117, '<td valign="top">Either black and white a toned image would have been better or just the original colors. Nice character and portrait. It never hurts to try different things for other probably like it. The main thing is you have to like it.</td>', 'Either black and white a toned image would have been better or just the original colors. Nice character and portrait. It never hurts to try different things for other probably like it. The main thing is you have to like it.', '2006-04-19 04:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
