(2324511, 320854, 52472, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Regrettably, the lighting looks quite flat. I think the picture would be far better if it was taken in the early morning or late afternoon with side-light. If this was not possible, I would have increased the highlights and shadows in post-processing. And also zoomed in a bit, the sky is not very interesting here... Just my 2 cents</td>', 'Nice subject. Regrettably, the lighting looks quite flat. I think the picture would be far better if it was taken in the early morning or late afternoon with side-light. If this was not possible, I would have increased the highlights and shadows in post-processing. And also zoomed in a bit, the sky is not very interesting here... Just my 2 cents', '2006-04-19 05:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
