(2325154, 322917, 45266, '<td valign="top">Out of the hundreds and hundreds of rusty vehicles entered in this challenge yours might just be one of the best. Although I would have darkened the lighter part of the building near the top because it sticks out a little to much. Good job.</td>', 'Out of the hundreds and hundreds of rusty vehicles entered in this challenge yours might just be one of the best. Although I would have darkened the lighter part of the building near the top because it sticks out a little to much. Good job.', '2006-04-19 09:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
