(2325218, 320848, 44611, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - I love it.  Was just scanning through the thumbs thinking I''d probably not vote on ''Old'' as there were so many entries.  Now I''ve found this, I have to vote 20% to make your 10 score count because you deserve it totally for creativity.  Good luck.</td>', 'Brilliant - I love it.  Was just scanning through the thumbs thinking I''d probably not vote on ''Old'' as there were so many entries.  Now I''ve found this, I have to vote 20% to make your 10 score count because you deserve it totally for creativity.  Good luck.', '2006-04-19 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325221, 323219, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is one of my personal favourites. This is definitely a ribbon candidate.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'This is one of my personal favourites. This is definitely a ribbon candidate.Good luck.', '2006-04-19 10:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325223, 320578, 31133, '<td valign="top">Except for the cloud in the upper right, I love the processing here. You (and the sun!) have done a great job with the colors and light. I''m scoring high, but bumping down a point for the cloud because my eye keeps going right at it.</td>', 'Except for the cloud in the upper right, I love the processing here. You (and the sun!) have done a great job with the colors and light. I''m scoring high, but bumping down a point for the cloud because my eye keeps going right at it.', '2006-04-19 10:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
