(2325302, 321844, 51638, '<td valign="top">I like this, but would have scored it higher if the windows weren''t so central. I''m no staunch devotee of the ''rule of thirds'', but here I think it would have worked for you.</td>', 'I like this, but would have scored it higher if the windows weren''t so central. I''m no staunch devotee of the ''rule of thirds'', but here I think it would have worked for you.', '2006-04-19 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
