(2325342, 321590, 19178, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition!  The blown out sky detracts from teh overall image.  YOu also need abit more shadow detail around the lower edge of the tire and front <br/>bumper.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition!  The blown out sky detracts from teh overall image.  YOu also need abit more shadow detail around the lower edge of the tire and front bumper.', '2006-04-19 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
