(2326774, 321302, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love the angles you''ve captured here, the shy and the toppling barns almost make you steady yourself when viewing. Great work.</td>', 'Love the angles you''ve captured here, the shy and the toppling barns almost make you steady yourself when viewing. Great work.', '2006-04-19 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
