(2327725, 323223, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.  I would like to see some of the text clearly though just for interest sake.</td>', 'I like it a lot.  I would like to see some of the text clearly though just for interest sake.', '2006-04-19 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327736, 322429, 48228, '<td valign="top">Plenty of tractors in this challenge, but it is old that for sure.....</td>', 'Plenty of tractors in this challenge, but it is old that for sure.....', '2006-04-19 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327737, 322345, 51802, '<td valign="top">Seems cropped a little close.</td>', 'Seems cropped a little close.', '2006-04-19 23:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327742, 321680, 48228, '<td valign="top">Great shot.....</td>', 'Great shot.....', '2006-04-19 23:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327748, 321329, 51553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Did it need to be sepia though?  The clouds are my favorite kind for dramatic color contrast, and I suspect there is some amazing color in the bridge as well.  I selfishly would have liked to see it.<br/> <br/>Hope you didn''t miss the "nice shot" part.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Did it need to be sepia though?  The clouds are my favorite kind for dramatic color contrast, and I suspect there is some amazing color in the bridge as well.  I selfishly would have liked to see it. Hope you didn''t miss the "nice shot" part.', '2006-04-19 23:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327751, 321211, 51802, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t convey "Old" to me.  This would be perfect in a "Rock n Roll" challenge!</td>', 'This just doesn''t convey "Old" to me.  This would be perfect in a "Rock n Roll" challenge!', '2006-04-19 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327756, 323047, 51553, '<td valign="top">Too much in the editing department...it looks a little "created".</td>', 'Too much in the editing department...it looks a little "created".', '2006-04-19 23:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327768, 322195, 51553, '<td valign="top">I would have named it "Spirata ''B''" and see if anybody got it.  I like the angle, it gives it a more artful appearance.</td>', 'I would have named it "Spirata ''B''" and see if anybody got it.  I like the angle, it gives it a more artful appearance.', '2006-04-19 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327769, 322981, 51802, '<td valign="top">The border might work better if it were darker.  The white just seems to wash out the picture.</td>', 'The border might work better if it were darker.  The white just seems to wash out the picture.', '2006-04-19 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327779, 320541, 51802, '<td valign="top">Was this shot though a window?  It seems to have some strange reflections in it.</td>', 'Was this shot though a window?  It seems to have some strange reflections in it.', '2006-04-19 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327782, 322809, 51802, '<td valign="top">Now that is an old bear!</td>', 'Now that is an old bear!', '2006-04-19 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327789, 323212, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the composition.  I think the camera and the manual being almost parallel to each other takes away from the "random" placement though.</td>', 'I like the idea of the composition.  I think the camera and the manual being almost parallel to each other takes away from the "random" placement though.', '2006-04-19 23:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327793, 323190, 51553, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2006-04-19 23:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327799, 322581, 51802, '<td valign="top">The DOF is too shallow for this shot.  It would be better if all the buttons were in focus, but keep the background in the top right corner blurry.</td>', 'The DOF is too shallow for this shot.  It would be better if all the buttons were in focus, but keep the background in the top right corner blurry.', '2006-04-19 23:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327800, 321020, 51553, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2006-04-19 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327807, 322772, 51553, '<td valign="top">This sure is a beauty.</td>', 'This sure is a beauty.', '2006-04-19 23:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327820, 322543, 51553, '<td valign="top">A little too "over cooked" for my taste.</td>', 'A little too "over cooked" for my taste.', '2006-04-19 23:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327824, 321776, 51553, '<td valign="top">A little heavy on the burn and dodge perhaps.</td>', 'A little heavy on the burn and dodge perhaps.', '2006-04-19 23:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327825, 320586, 51802, '<td valign="top">Looks like the DoF is too shallow.  It makes the chair the focal point of this picture. The equipment in the foreground, which is slightly out of focus, would be much better as the main subject.</td>', 'Looks like the DoF is too shallow.  It makes the chair the focal point of this picture. The equipment in the foreground, which is slightly out of focus, would be much better as the main subject.', '2006-04-19 23:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327828, 323177, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great job freezing the flames.</td>', 'Great job freezing the flames.', '2006-04-19 23:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327830, 320854, 51553, '<td valign="top">I think a little contrast would make this jump off the page.  Very good detail.</td>', 'I think a little contrast would make this jump off the page.  Very good detail.', '2006-04-19 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327833, 320146, 51802, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  Did you put the text in this shot?  There is a good chance this will get DQ''d.</td>', 'Oh wow.  Did you put the text in this shot?  There is a good chance this will get DQ''d.', '2006-04-19 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327835, 322566, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like the boat being shaded on the one side.</td>', 'I like the boat being shaded on the one side.', '2006-04-19 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327845, 322882, 51553, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2006-04-19 23:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327850, 322242, 51553, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF.</td>', 'Excellent DOF.', '2006-04-19 23:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327855, 321393, 51553, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.</td>', 'Neat shot.', '2006-04-19 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327857, 322908, 51553, '<td valign="top">Has a very dark feel to it.  Very well done.</td>', 'Has a very dark feel to it.  Very well done.', '2006-04-19 23:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327861, 322570, 51553, '<td valign="top">I think the shot is amazing.  But I''m not convinced that they are retired.</td>', 'I think the shot is amazing.  But I''m not convinced that they are retired.', '2006-04-20 00:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327862, 322629, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is one of those tough shots.  You need to be close enough to make the subject clear, but yet give enough perspective to understand what that subject is.  Some of my early challenge entries suffered this same problem.  I found that I had to fight the urge to enter anyway when I couldn''t get my shots just right. (Please take this in a good way, because that is how it is meant.)</td>', 'This is one of those tough shots.  You need to be close enough to make the subject clear, but yet give enough perspective to understand what that subject is.  Some of my early challenge entries suffered this same problem.  I found that I had to fight the urge to enter anyway when I couldn''t get my shots just right. (Please take this in a good way, because that is how it is meant.)', '2006-04-20 00:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327870, 323200, 51802, '<td valign="top">Seems overprocessed.  There is some ghosting around the red needles.  This may be from over sharpening.</td>', 'Seems overprocessed.  There is some ghosting around the red needles.  This may be from over sharpening.', '2006-04-20 00:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327873, 321716, 51553, '<td valign="top">Other than the betraying texture of the cloth on the left side, this really looks like dunes.  I think the highlights and shadows are perfect.</td>', 'Other than the betraying texture of the cloth on the left side, this really looks like dunes.  I think the highlights and shadows are perfect.', '2006-04-20 00:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327877, 323085, 51553, '<td valign="top">This should be a print!</td>', 'This should be a print!', '2006-04-20 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
