(2328928, 320669, 5728, '<td valign="top">The sky comes on well, the water is too green for me though. (Although the green tone does fit the orange in the sky). I am guessing you implemented a kind of gradient filter or atmosphere filter on this?</td>', 'The sky comes on well, the water is too green for me though. (Although the green tone does fit the orange in the sky). I am guessing you implemented a kind of gradient filter or atmosphere filter on this?', '2006-04-20 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
