(2329228, 322880, 22937, '<td valign="top">Woaah, I did recognise this building immediately. During my only visit to RSA in nov 2003, on the way back (to Pelindaba) from the Kruger Park, we had lunch in Pilgrims rest. Prior to this pitstop I had been looking hard to find a mailbox (&gt; 1 week) for my cards. The one I finally found was located in this building. This picture brought some memories back to me - therefor I''ll give you a 10, many thanks!   <br/> <br/>The picture: Great focus on the main item - the house. Nice clouds - great feeling!</td>', 'Woaah, I did recognise this building immediately. During my only visit to RSA in nov 2003, on the way back (to Pelindaba) from the Kruger Park, we had lunch in Pilgrims rest. Prior to this pitstop I had been looking hard to find a mailbox (> 1 week) for my cards. The one I finally found was located in this building. This picture brought some memories back to me - therefor I''ll give you a 10, many thanks!    The picture: Great focus on the main item - the house. Nice clouds - great feeling!', '2006-04-20 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
