(2329506, 320906, 47117, '<td valign="top">Love the dof on the man. Great face. Great character, great emotion. Would have made a terrific candid as well. It''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'Love the dof on the man. Great face. Great character, great emotion. Would have made a terrific candid as well. It''s a 10 for me.', '2006-04-20 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329507, 322154, 47117, '<td valign="top">WOW, what an odd shot. Reminds me of old shots from the old asian movies my father used to watch. LOL..it''s a 9 from me!</td>', 'WOW, what an odd shot. Reminds me of old shots from the old asian movies my father used to watch. LOL..it''s a 9 from me!', '2006-04-20 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329509, 321800, 47117, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors. I figure about a one minute exposure on the sky?  Very nicely done.  It''s a 9 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors. I figure about a one minute exposure on the sky?  Very nicely done.  It''s a 9 from me.', '2006-04-20 14:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329510, 321622, 47117, '<td valign="top">WOW, this was my actual entry! LOL...Went to a rodeo last weekend. Unfortunately, it was at night and under a covered arena. Needless to say the bad lighting did not allow for a high shutter speed, and I lost my shots. I was so bummed!  <br/> <br/>Just for FYI, as I did this research for my own shot:  The Rodeo began in Chyanne in 1872, as to an actual official contest, but started long before then as games the cowboys on the ranges used to play among themselves before it became an actual sport.<br/> <br/>I am so glad to see this shot though. I''m rating it high.</td>', 'WOW, this was my actual entry! LOL...Went to a rodeo last weekend. Unfortunately, it was at night and under a covered arena. Needless to say the bad lighting did not allow for a high shutter speed, and I lost my shots. I was so bummed!   Just for FYI, as I did this research for my own shot:  The Rodeo began in Chyanne in 1872, as to an actual official contest, but started long before then as games the cowboys on the ranges used to play among themselves before it became an actual sport. I am so glad to see this shot though. I''m rating it high.', '2006-04-20 14:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329512, 320899, 47117, '<td valign="top">Great tones. I love the story here. The title needed no question mark though.  Nice focus on both the anchor and the building is a terrific job well done technically. It''s a 9 for me.</td>', 'Great tones. I love the story here. The title needed no question mark though.  Nice focus on both the anchor and the building is a terrific job well done technically. It''s a 9 for me.', '2006-04-20 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329513, 322543, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of these sharpened type images. It really brings out the detail in the intricate work on buildings and walkways, especially in this image.  Very beautiful. A 9 for me!</td>', 'I''m a big fan of these sharpened type images. It really brings out the detail in the intricate work on buildings and walkways, especially in this image.  Very beautiful. A 9 for me!', '2006-04-20 14:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329515, 323219, 47117, '<td valign="top">Nice message. Gorgeous photo. Love the crop and techs.  Love how the sand is perfectly molded. Very Zen like. It''s a 9 for me!</td>', 'Nice message. Gorgeous photo. Love the crop and techs.  Love how the sand is perfectly molded. Very Zen like. It''s a 9 for me!', '2006-04-20 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329531, 322071, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ha! I don''t want to like this because it''s such a mess, but it makes me smile like a fool, and well I guess I have to admit - I like it! 6, would''ve been higher if I didn''t want to dislike it so much :-)</td>', 'Ha! I don''t want to like this because it''s such a mess, but it makes me smile like a fool, and well I guess I have to admit - I like it! 6, would''ve been higher if I didn''t want to dislike it so much :-)', '2006-04-20 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329534, 322907, 48268, '<td valign="top">I love mills!  Where is this?</td>', 'I love mills!  Where is this?', '2006-04-20 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329537, 320595, 31133, '<td valign="top">Definitely a winner. Look at that old floor and the light shining in on the ripped up chair cushion... this is just fine, very fine. (except I wish the chair was on the left instead of the right side of the frame :-) 8</td>', 'Definitely a winner. Look at that old floor and the light shining in on the ripped up chair cushion... this is just fine, very fine. (except I wish the chair was on the left instead of the right side of the frame :-) 8', '2006-04-20 14:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329545, 321840, 31133, '<td valign="top">She looks like a lovable, kind, and intelligent woman. I love the sharp focus you have and that glint in her eye, but I wish the light was slightly different, to eliminate some of the shiny spots on her skin. The light in her hair, however, is perfect.</td>', 'She looks like a lovable, kind, and intelligent woman. I love the sharp focus you have and that glint in her eye, but I wish the light was slightly different, to eliminate some of the shiny spots on her skin. The light in her hair, however, is perfect.', '2006-04-20 14:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329553, 321016, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything old in this photo. Perhaps the dress is old but how is the viewer supposed to know that? Image seems a little dull, could use brighter lighting.</td>', 'I don''t see anything old in this photo. Perhaps the dress is old but how is the viewer supposed to know that? Image seems a little dull, could use brighter lighting.', '2006-04-20 14:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329555, 322784, 43774, '<td valign="top">It appears you have problems with pixelation....try a better compression size when resizing and saving.</td>', 'It appears you have problems with pixelation....try a better compression size when resizing and saving.', '2006-04-20 14:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329557, 322578, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is old in this photo. Subject (people on a boat?) is too far away and abscured by shadows of trees it appears</td>', 'Not sure what is old in this photo. Subject (people on a boat?) is too far away and abscured by shadows of trees it appears', '2006-04-20 14:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329558, 321497, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fine old barn and the tall grass adds interest, but I do wish there were less neat image.</td>', 'Fine old barn and the tall grass adds interest, but I do wish there were less neat image.', '2006-04-20 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329560, 321005, 43774, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of the processing you did on this....everything has an unnatural green glow, the skin is too smooth and lacks detail. Composition is fine though.</td>', 'I am not fond of the processing you did on this....everything has an unnatural green glow, the skin is too smooth and lacks detail. Composition is fine though.', '2006-04-20 14:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329562, 321863, 48268, '<td valign="top">I kinda wish the truck wasn''t in the picture, or that it was as delapidated as the house.</td>', 'I kinda wish the truck wasn''t in the picture, or that it was as delapidated as the house.', '2006-04-20 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329563, 323200, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the tone/colour. The thin needles in the middle seem to be glowing and out of focus, very odd looking.</td>', 'Not fond of the tone/colour. The thin needles in the middle seem to be glowing and out of focus, very odd looking.', '2006-04-20 14:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329565, 322154, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the yellow tone. I think the photo would be more dramatic in B&amp;W as he is old and this photo does fit the challenge; the background of stone also looks old with interesting textures in it.</td>', 'Not fond of the yellow tone. I think the photo would be more dramatic in B&W as he is old and this photo does fit the challenge; the background of stone also looks old with interesting textures in it.', '2006-04-20 14:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329566, 321860, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image looks out of focus and washed out. Perhaps more contrast would help, also not having the shack so centered would improve the composition.</td>', 'Image looks out of focus and washed out. Perhaps more contrast would help, also not having the shack so centered would improve the composition.', '2006-04-20 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329567, 322811, 15561, '<td valign="top">Good.</td>', 'Good.', '2006-04-20 14:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329570, 323023, 43774, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t appear to be quite in focus. Shame, because it looks like a great old truck with lots of rust to really suit the challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t appear to be quite in focus. Shame, because it looks like a great old truck with lots of rust to really suit the challenge.', '2006-04-20 14:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329571, 321301, 54826, '<td valign="top">This caught my eye... great photo. <br/>A little oversharpened for my taste though.</td>', 'This caught my eye... great photo. A little oversharpened for my taste though.', '2006-04-20 14:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329572, 322969, 31133, '<td valign="top">This has GOT to get a ribbon! It''s the only one I''m faving right now (193 votes so far). Everything about this image has appeal for me: That look and that huge beard in particular. Also love the strong blacks and whites in tone.</td>', 'This has GOT to get a ribbon! It''s the only one I''m faving right now (193 votes so far). Everything about this image has appeal for me: That look and that huge beard in particular. Also love the strong blacks and whites in tone.', '2006-04-20 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329575, 322219, 43774, '<td valign="top">Out of focus parts in front are really distracting. If you had just focused on the other parts among the trees it would have been a stronger composition.</td>', 'Out of focus parts in front are really distracting. If you had just focused on the other parts among the trees it would have been a stronger composition.', '2006-04-20 14:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
