(2329789, 321005, 37818, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it is a little over processed for my taste..and for me, it doesnt scream "old"  perhaps if the subject were older, or the leaves in the broken glass were brown and not so bright and fresh...I think it would have been outstanding for "broken"...just imho, of course!</td>', 'I like this, but it is a little over processed for my taste..and for me, it doesnt scream "old"  perhaps if the subject were older, or the leaves in the broken glass were brown and not so bright and fresh...I think it would have been outstanding for "broken"...just imho, of course!', '2006-04-20 15:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329796, 321211, 37818, '<td valign="top">For me this is too busy. The background needs work, you can see the lights in the skull and it is a tad OOF.<br/>The lighting in the eye sockets is nice, and the colours are intersting, but attention to details would help this shot, IMHO</td>', 'For me this is too busy. The background needs work, you can see the lights in the skull and it is a tad OOF.The lighting in the eye sockets is nice, and the colours are intersting, but attention to details would help this shot, IMHO', '2006-04-20 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
