(2330560, 321721, 12857, '<td valign="top">I think I might have liked the photo better without the (stick?) in the forground.  I am not sure if it adds anything to the photo for me and It I feel  distracts from the subject.  On the plus side the exposure is well balanced and has a nice tonal range.</td>', 'I think I might have liked the photo better without the (stick?) in the forground.  I am not sure if it adds anything to the photo for me and It I feel  distracts from the subject.  On the plus side the exposure is well balanced and has a nice tonal range.', '2006-04-20 20:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
