(2330619, 320124, 13759, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I neet to tell you... It seems to be done with a 300KP cell phone camera. Even the most simple DC can do a great job if you stop to think about your picture. Are here great pictures not taken with modern DSLRs, but amazing pictures that one can´t distinguish from the pro´s.<br/>Next time try to use your imagination and take time to play with the light. Even if your camera has limited resources you can make great thing here.<br/>My set of counsels to this picture:<br/>1 - Put the subject at stationary position, a table top, cell support or else.<br/>2 - Rest you camera on a tripod or other fixed surface.<br/>3 -Put your hand behind the phone to get the motion blur or feel sensation like you get here.<br/>4 - Use other light sources, difuse your flash with kidnaps and be creative.<br/>Hope see your next submission!</td>', 'Sorry but I neet to tell you... It seems to be done with a 300KP cell phone camera. Even the most simple DC can do a great job if you stop to think about your picture. Are here great pictures not taken with modern DSLRs, but amazing pictures that one can´t distinguish from the pro´s.Next time try to use your imagination and take time to play with the light. Even if your camera has limited resources you can make great thing here.My set of counsels to this picture:1 - Put the subject at stationary position, a table top, cell support or else.2 - Rest you camera on a tripod or other fixed surface.3 -Put your hand behind the phone to get the motion blur or feel sensation like you get here.4 - Use other light sources, difuse your flash with kidnaps and be creative.Hope see your next submission!', '2006-04-20 20:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330620, 321005, 13759, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection role played by the glass.</td>', 'Interesting reflection role played by the glass.', '2006-04-20 20:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330624, 323085, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots in the bunch.  Though the composition is strong it is the lighting that really makes this for me.  Great job</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots in the bunch.  Though the composition is strong it is the lighting that really makes this for me.  Great job', '2006-04-20 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
