(2330785, 321005, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photograph. I love the softness of the subject contrasting with the hard edges of the glass.  The subject stares right through you almost like he is saying what do you know about me? Nothing! I may not know him but I can feel him.  The reflection of the green leaves (portraying life )is shattered, just like the shatterd soul of this youth.  At least that is what I can see.  I would hang this on my wall next to my Greg Gorman photos.  10</td>', 'This is a fantastic photograph. I love the softness of the subject contrasting with the hard edges of the glass.  The subject stares right through you almost like he is saying what do you know about me? Nothing! I may not know him but I can feel him.  The reflection of the green leaves (portraying life )is shattered, just like the shatterd soul of this youth.  At least that is what I can see.  I would hang this on my wall next to my Greg Gorman photos.  10', '2006-04-20 21:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330786, 323093, 70, '<td valign="top">Hang down your head, Tom Dooley?<br/> <br/>I like the colors in this and the sky is impressive. The line of the headstone leads your eye into a bit of a dead end though, ending at the next headstone. Perhaps a more straight on shot would help this?</td>', 'Hang down your head, Tom Dooley? I like the colors in this and the sky is impressive. The line of the headstone leads your eye into a bit of a dead end though, ending at the next headstone. Perhaps a more straight on shot would help this?', '2006-04-20 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330793, 321267, 70, '<td valign="top">Old indeed. Picture could have used a bit of a wider crop - the way it butts against the left side and is maybe even cut off a bit on the top makes it feel cramped. Sepia toning is a good idea but this seems a tad on the pinky side.</td>', 'Old indeed. Picture could have used a bit of a wider crop - the way it butts against the left side and is maybe even cut off a bit on the top makes it feel cramped. Sepia toning is a good idea but this seems a tad on the pinky side.', '2006-04-20 21:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
