(2331147, 321273, 51802, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this shot, especially the reflections in the camera lens.</td>', 'I love the lighting in this shot, especially the reflections in the camera lens.', '2006-04-20 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331149, 321005, 53859, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too much post processing</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too much post processing', '2006-04-20 23:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331152, 320737, 51802, '<td valign="top">Seems just a little over exposed.</td>', 'Seems just a little over exposed.', '2006-04-20 23:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331153, 322091, 51802, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot!</td>', 'Wow! Great shot!', '2006-04-20 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331157, 321464, 49202, '<td valign="top">Rusty frame... for a title as such, I would expect to SEE rust, not have to look for it.<br/>I don''t think this would sit well with the general populace of this site, being as it is a photograph of a photograph. Also, there''s one too many "border-haters" in this site than what is healthy and, TTYTT, borders other than black or white are marked down faster than you could say <i>pwet</i> so I suggest you stick to black, white, or no borders.<br/>This photo''s okay, if not a bit too washed out. I, however, find it strangely familiar and, to some extent, touching. So I am giving this a 10.</td>', 'Rusty frame... for a title as such, I would expect to SEE rust, not have to look for it.I don''t think this would sit well with the general populace of this site, being as it is a photograph of a photograph. Also, there''s one too many "border-haters" in this site than what is healthy and, TTYTT, borders other than black or white are marked down faster than you could say pwet so I suggest you stick to black, white, or no borders.This photo''s okay, if not a bit too washed out. I, however, find it strangely familiar and, to some extent, touching. So I am giving this a 10.', '2006-04-20 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331158, 323201, 51802, '<td valign="top">What a lucky find!!!</td>', 'What a lucky find!!!', '2006-04-20 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331159, 322325, 53859, '<td valign="top">my eyes kept being drawn toward the towers</td>', 'my eyes kept being drawn toward the towers', '2006-04-20 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
