(2331345, 320971, 51802, '<td valign="top">Not sure using a white background for a white dress works well.  It makes the picture look washed out.</td>', 'Not sure using a white background for a white dress works well.  It makes the picture look washed out.', '2006-04-20 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
