(2331829, 321917, 42792, '<td valign="top">That orange tinge in the sky and the low angle really makes this awesome.  Very well done!</td>', 'That orange tinge in the sky and the low angle really makes this awesome.  Very well done!', '2006-04-21 05:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331833, 322466, 42792, '<td valign="top">The lighting and background really makes this photo stand out.  Definitely the best shot of an old camera in this challenge.  Just a small detail: I would have preferred to see the whole camera in focus and not just the shutter.  8.</td>', 'The lighting and background really makes this photo stand out.  Definitely the best shot of an old camera in this challenge.  Just a small detail: I would have preferred to see the whole camera in focus and not just the shutter.  8.', '2006-04-21 05:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331841, 322791, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is a simple shot that says so much.  Very nice photo-documentary piece.  Some editing could be used to just tweak it a little and really make it pop, eg. slight sharpening as it looks a tiny bit soft, a little more contrast perhaps too.  A 7 for me.</td>', 'This is a simple shot that says so much.  Very nice photo-documentary piece.  Some editing could be used to just tweak it a little and really make it pop, eg. slight sharpening as it looks a tiny bit soft, a little more contrast perhaps too.  A 7 for me.', '2006-04-21 05:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331844, 320090, 42792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great angle and idea on opening up the watch!  Cant tell what the background is but it adds interest to the whole shot.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great angle and idea on opening up the watch!  Cant tell what the background is but it adds interest to the whole shot.', '2006-04-21 05:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331848, 321722, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like the extreme angle here.  Makes this shot stand out. 7.</td>', 'Like the extreme angle here.  Makes this shot stand out. 7.', '2006-04-21 05:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331855, 322154, 42792, '<td valign="top">Totally love this - subject and treatment merge together wonderfully.  It evokes a lovely nostalgic feel of an era gone by.  Bumping up to 8.</td>', 'Totally love this - subject and treatment merge together wonderfully.  It evokes a lovely nostalgic feel of an era gone by.  Bumping up to 8.', '2006-04-21 05:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331860, 322769, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones.</td>', 'Nice warm tones.', '2006-04-21 05:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331885, 322588, 4281, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the red color cast - could be fixed with quite many tools in Photoshop etc, such as using the levels tool and move the sliders for the green and blue channels to the left. It would have been nice had there been slightly more space above the bottle.<br/> <br/>I think it would also have made for a much nicer image had you poured a bit of the wine in a wineglass and placed it in front and to the left or right of the bottle. The photo is a bit uninteresting as it is and it''s often better to have a bit of a space to the sides for vertical subjects.</td>', 'I don''t like the red color cast - could be fixed with quite many tools in Photoshop etc, such as using the levels tool and move the sliders for the green and blue channels to the left. It would have been nice had there been slightly more space above the bottle. I think it would also have made for a much nicer image had you poured a bit of the wine in a wineglass and placed it in front and to the left or right of the bottle. The photo is a bit uninteresting as it is and it''s often better to have a bit of a space to the sides for vertical subjects.', '2006-04-21 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331887, 322567, 46270, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice tree stump. Composition is brilliant.</td>', 'Wow, nice tree stump. Composition is brilliant.', '2006-04-21 06:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331893, 322820, 4281, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I quite like the sheeps on the lawn and the color treatment. I''m perhaps not absolutely sure but I somehow feel the sky is a bit overdramatic for my taste. Still it''s quite a cool picture. Good luck!</td>', 'Really nice, I quite like the sheeps on the lawn and the color treatment. I''m perhaps not absolutely sure but I somehow feel the sky is a bit overdramatic for my taste. Still it''s quite a cool picture. Good luck!', '2006-04-21 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331911, 320578, 4281, '<td valign="top">Aaah, such a nice background but I feel the eyes need something to focus on here and those two poles serve that purpose to a point ... but still, not well enough. Would have been quite nice with a person on the image, for example to the left looking upwards or to the right contemplating.</td>', 'Aaah, such a nice background but I feel the eyes need something to focus on here and those two poles serve that purpose to a point ... but still, not well enough. Would have been quite nice with a person on the image, for example to the left looking upwards or to the right contemplating.', '2006-04-21 06:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331917, 321776, 4281, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the angle and the window. I would like to have some definition in the shadow area to the right though..</td>', 'Nice, I like the angle and the window. I would like to have some definition in the shadow area to the right though..', '2006-04-21 06:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331934, 322572, 56502, '<td valign="top">I think the barbed wire across the main motive is not so ideal.</td>', 'I think the barbed wire across the main motive is not so ideal.', '2006-04-21 06:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
