(2333630, 322847, 4411, '<td valign="top">A bit of advanced editing wouldn''t have gone amiss on this one. The cable is an eyesore on an otherwise well executed shot.</td>', 'A bit of advanced editing wouldn''t have gone amiss on this one. The cable is an eyesore on an otherwise well executed shot.', '2006-04-21 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333634, 321724, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love the rust colors on this image.....</td>', 'Love the rust colors on this image.....', '2006-04-21 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333639, 320595, 4411, '<td valign="top">I think you need to have words with your cleaner ; )<br/>Excellent interpretation of the dirty, greasy, nasty, broken meaning of old.</td>', 'I think you need to have words with your cleaner ; )Excellent interpretation of the dirty, greasy, nasty, broken meaning of old.', '2006-04-21 19:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333640, 322773, 48228, '<td valign="top">magic sky.....</td>', 'magic sky.....', '2006-04-21 19:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333642, 321418, 31133, '<td valign="top">This could use a litttle less of the bright lights, in my opinion. Wonder if it would be nice with the brightest light at right cropped out?</td>', 'This could use a litttle less of the bright lights, in my opinion. Wonder if it would be nice with the brightest light at right cropped out?', '2006-04-21 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333643, 320620, 55394, '<td valign="top">gret photo, i love the darkness gives a hint of sadness 10 from me</td>', 'gret photo, i love the darkness gives a hint of sadness 10 from me', '2006-04-21 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333644, 321605, 48228, '<td valign="top">Now this is old.....</td>', 'Now this is old.....', '2006-04-21 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333646, 321411, 48228, '<td valign="top">Harsh, but good...</td>', 'Harsh, but good...', '2006-04-21 19:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333655, 322543, 55394, '<td valign="top">wow, i love this, the pathway draws you into it, the only thing is the circle in the middle, i can''t take my eye off it, it distracts you from the rest of the photo, its a 9 from me</td>', 'wow, i love this, the pathway draws you into it, the only thing is the circle in the middle, i can''t take my eye off it, it distracts you from the rest of the photo, its a 9 from me', '2006-04-21 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333659, 320669, 49773, '<td valign="top">Appealin colours, somehow I don''t like the blur, I would prefer everything in focus.</td>', 'Appealin colours, somehow I don''t like the blur, I would prefer everything in focus.', '2006-04-21 19:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333666, 320124, 55394, '<td valign="top">i don''t mean to be rude but this isn''t a good photo, it''s not clear, and to me it isn''t exactly old.... old to you maybe, i guess different people have different perceptions. 2 from me</td>', 'i don''t mean to be rude but this isn''t a good photo, it''s not clear, and to me it isn''t exactly old.... old to you maybe, i guess different people have different perceptions. 2 from me', '2006-04-21 20:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333765, 321496, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''m really struggling to see what this is.</td>', 'I''m really struggling to see what this is.', '2006-04-21 20:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333809, 321760, 55642, '<td valign="top">The sky and buildings in the background are just a touch washed out, though the bridge is lovely.</td>', 'The sky and buildings in the background are just a touch washed out, though the bridge is lovely.', '2006-04-21 21:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333817, 322999, 55642, '<td valign="top">A little too much of a snapshot, especially with the flash glare on the Bendix.</td>', 'A little too much of a snapshot, especially with the flash glare on the Bendix.', '2006-04-21 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333819, 320588, 55642, '<td valign="top">The trees look too skinny to be old. How does this fit the challenge?</td>', 'The trees look too skinny to be old. How does this fit the challenge?', '2006-04-21 21:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333827, 323178, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I think you needed a few warmer-toned light sources coming from several different directions - the shadows cast by the sewing machine are distracting. The light you <i>do</i> have is too white and too harsh for the scene as well, as it washes out the book cover.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I think you needed a few warmer-toned light sources coming from several different directions - the shadows cast by the sewing machine are distracting. The light you do have is too white and too harsh for the scene as well, as it washes out the book cover.', '2006-04-21 21:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333835, 322823, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is "old" how? Besides the dubiousness of whether or not this belongs in this challenge, the photo quality isn''t great either. The depth of field on the bone is all wrong, the color looks distorted - it really looks like a very generic bad snapshot.</td>', 'This is "old" how? Besides the dubiousness of whether or not this belongs in this challenge, the photo quality isn''t great either. The depth of field on the bone is all wrong, the color looks distorted - it really looks like a very generic bad snapshot.', '2006-04-21 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333840, 321365, 55642, '<td valign="top">It looks very crisp in the foreground, but the background is so dark that the bottom and right edges of the camera are totally lost.</td>', 'It looks very crisp in the foreground, but the background is so dark that the bottom and right edges of the camera are totally lost.', '2006-04-21 21:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333845, 322497, 55642, '<td valign="top">There''s something blurry at the bottom that is very distracting. I would try this on a square crop and completely eliminate the clutter at the bottom. The pic is also a bit overexposed. I would turn the shutter speed up a notch or try to fix it with some contrast and increased saturation.</td>', 'There''s something blurry at the bottom that is very distracting. I would try this on a square crop and completely eliminate the clutter at the bottom. The pic is also a bit overexposed. I would turn the shutter speed up a notch or try to fix it with some contrast and increased saturation.', '2006-04-21 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333858, 323219, 55642, '<td valign="top">The picture is really lovely, but I think this is really a stretch for fitting the theme. "Old" isn''t what comes to mind when I look at this. I would have given it an 8 or 9 if it really nailed the theme.</td>', 'The picture is really lovely, but I think this is really a stretch for fitting the theme. "Old" isn''t what comes to mind when I look at this. I would have given it an 8 or 9 if it really nailed the theme.', '2006-04-21 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333866, 322810, 55642, '<td valign="top">This composition has a lot of potential. Unfortunately it''s not very sharp. I probably would have increased the saturation and slightly bumped up the contrast as well (say +5 at most), for a little extra dazzle.</td>', 'This composition has a lot of potential. Unfortunately it''s not very sharp. I probably would have increased the saturation and slightly bumped up the contrast as well (say +5 at most), for a little extra dazzle.', '2006-04-21 21:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333871, 321496, 55642, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to figure out what this was.. the big black speaker looming in the foreground is very distracting because it is badly out of focus and yet takes up so much of the frame. I feel like I''m missing half the photo.</td>', 'It took me awhile to figure out what this was.. the big black speaker looming in the foreground is very distracting because it is badly out of focus and yet takes up so much of the frame. I feel like I''m missing half the photo.', '2006-04-21 21:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333873, 321211, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the skull be crystal clear, sharp crisp lines. The lack of focus definitely hurts the composition.</td>', 'I would like to see the skull be crystal clear, sharp crisp lines. The lack of focus definitely hurts the composition.', '2006-04-21 21:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333885, 321719, 55642, '<td valign="top">If it isn''t old, then how does it fit the challenge? Stricly about the photo, the bird''s shoulder feathers are sharper than his face, where the focus should be.</td>', 'If it isn''t old, then how does it fit the challenge? Stricly about the photo, the bird''s shoulder feathers are sharper than his face, where the focus should be.', '2006-04-21 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333894, 321622, 55642, '<td valign="top">The cowboy is young, the horse is young, the calf is young... I definitely would not make the connection to anything about this photo being "old" without the title to tell me so, which makes its inclusion in this challenge a bit of a stretch. My score would be several points higher if it nailed the challenge.</td>', 'The cowboy is young, the horse is young, the calf is young... I definitely would not make the connection to anything about this photo being "old" without the title to tell me so, which makes its inclusion in this challenge a bit of a stretch. My score would be several points higher if it nailed the challenge.', '2006-04-21 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333899, 322918, 55642, '<td valign="top">Very overexposed. Increase your shutter speed by a click or two.</td>', 'Very overexposed. Increase your shutter speed by a click or two.', '2006-04-21 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333903, 320309, 55642, '<td valign="top">The cameo itself is out of focus - looks like the blanket it''s resting on is a lot sharper in the foreground.</td>', 'The cameo itself is out of focus - looks like the blanket it''s resting on is a lot sharper in the foreground.', '2006-04-21 21:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333905, 321430, 14211, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2006-04-21 21:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333908, 323200, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the deal is with the radioactive mini needle thingies..? The post-shoot work done on that area looks very weird.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the deal is with the radioactive mini needle thingies..? The post-shoot work done on that area looks very weird.', '2006-04-21 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333910, 322977, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats wonderful, great shot.</td>', 'Thats wonderful, great shot.', '2006-04-21 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2333915, 321401, 14211, '<td valign="top">love the contrast</td>', 'love the contrast', '2006-04-21 21:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333924, 321771, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to get closer in to the building - it looks a lot more interesting than the sky and tree top. I would be shooting all over this building, not so far back from it.</td>', 'I would like to get closer in to the building - it looks a lot more interesting than the sky and tree top. I would be shooting all over this building, not so far back from it.', '2006-04-21 21:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333926, 320697, 55642, '<td valign="top">Is the dog old?</td>', 'Is the dog old?', '2006-04-21 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333929, 322502, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are way too many old cameras in this challenge. It''s one of the better shots, but still...</td>', 'There are way too many old cameras in this challenge. It''s one of the better shots, but still...', '2006-04-21 22:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333931, 320872, 55642, '<td valign="top">Great texture in this photo, nice clarity - the only thing that distracts is the white space in the upper left corner. It feels like you cut the corner off.  I''d like to see the wall and stairs fill the entire frame.</td>', 'Great texture in this photo, nice clarity - the only thing that distracts is the white space in the upper left corner. It feels like you cut the corner off.  I''d like to see the wall and stairs fill the entire frame.', '2006-04-21 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333932, 322821, 52500, '<td valign="top">Oh my....I''ll bet you are getting some interesting comments on this one....<br/>Here''s my take:<br/> <br/>Certainly meets the challenge.  A very accurate and creative depiction of old.  I think it is technically a good photo.  Good focus, light, etc.  The only downside I see is that the subject matter is rather sickening (but I''m sure you knew that already!)  You get an 8 from me for a good photo and the bravery to enter it!</td>', 'Oh my....I''ll bet you are getting some interesting comments on this one....Here''s my take: Certainly meets the challenge.  A very accurate and creative depiction of old.  I think it is technically a good photo.  Good focus, light, etc.  The only downside I see is that the subject matter is rather sickening (but I''m sure you knew that already!)  You get an 8 from me for a good photo and the bravery to enter it!', '2006-04-21 22:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333933, 322491, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is too funny!  What a great idea and a great looking photo.</td>', 'This is too funny!  What a great idea and a great looking photo.', '2006-04-21 22:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333934, 322802, 14211, '<td valign="top">you can feel the thoughts.</td>', 'you can feel the thoughts.', '2006-04-21 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333936, 322978, 52500, '<td valign="top">Whatever processing you did on this pic is fabulous.  I love this look.</td>', 'Whatever processing you did on this pic is fabulous.  I love this look.', '2006-04-21 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333938, 323125, 55642, '<td valign="top">The perspective here is just odd. The weighting is disconcerting. The wheels should be anchored to the bottom of the picture. Remember that the bottom of a picture is almost always perceived to be the ground, the front, closer, etc. Anything that looms large in the top of the frame looks like it''s flying and that just doesn''t work in this photo''s favor. I''d also like to see more of the object you''re shooting and less of its rock stage.</td>', 'The perspective here is just odd. The weighting is disconcerting. The wheels should be anchored to the bottom of the picture. Remember that the bottom of a picture is almost always perceived to be the ground, the front, closer, etc. Anything that looms large in the top of the frame looks like it''s flying and that just doesn''t work in this photo''s favor. I''d also like to see more of the object you''re shooting and less of its rock stage.', '2006-04-21 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333943, 322784, 55642, '<td valign="top">It looks like the picture quality suffered when it was uploaded - it''s very pixelated, even in the corners. This could easily have been cropped to a portrait orientation, and that might have saved a bit on the file size. If I can''t Save for Web at 80% <i>minimum</i>, I won''t upload it.</td>', 'It looks like the picture quality suffered when it was uploaded - it''s very pixelated, even in the corners. This could easily have been cropped to a portrait orientation, and that might have saved a bit on the file size. If I can''t Save for Web at 80% minimum, I won''t upload it.', '2006-04-21 22:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333953, 322809, 55642, '<td valign="top">Good texture. I''d like to see this with more color saturation, though, maybe a +5 on contrast.</td>', 'Good texture. I''d like to see this with more color saturation, though, maybe a +5 on contrast.', '2006-04-21 22:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333955, 321916, 55642, '<td valign="top">The toe is too close to the left edge. There''s something to be cropped out of the upper right corner. Needs to be brighter, sharper, more contrast. As is, this looks like nothing more than a bad snapshot.</td>', 'The toe is too close to the left edge. There''s something to be cropped out of the upper right corner. Needs to be brighter, sharper, more contrast. As is, this looks like nothing more than a bad snapshot.', '2006-04-21 22:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333956, 321701, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I love the contrast between the old and the new (I spy the golden arches in the corner!)</td>', 'Great composition.  I love the contrast between the old and the new (I spy the golden arches in the corner!)', '2006-04-21 22:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333957, 323177, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of story here, and a clear, interesting image.</td>', 'Nice sense of story here, and a clear, interesting image.', '2006-04-21 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333958, 321005, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great reflections off of the bits of glass.</td>', 'Great reflections off of the bits of glass.', '2006-04-21 22:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333962, 321904, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and atmosphere in this close up. I like the diagonal line of the box, too.</td>', 'Nice detail and atmosphere in this close up. I like the diagonal line of the box, too.', '2006-04-21 22:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333963, 321605, 14211, '<td valign="top">I really like the colour and the shadows . I can feel the motion.</td>', 'I really like the colour and the shadows . I can feel the motion.', '2006-04-21 22:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333966, 321860, 55642, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper, more color saturation.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper, more color saturation.', '2006-04-21 22:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333967, 321236, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice patterns here! The buckets make a very unique and effective composition.</td>', 'Very nice patterns here! The buckets make a very unique and effective composition.', '2006-04-21 22:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333970, 320888, 55642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but just a touch too dark.</td>', 'Beautiful, but just a touch too dark.', '2006-04-21 22:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333978, 321016, 55642, '<td valign="top">Is this old somehow?</td>', 'Is this old somehow?', '2006-04-21 22:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333982, 321800, 14211, '<td valign="top">love the colours (colors)</td>', 'love the colours (colors)', '2006-04-21 22:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333983, 322413, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great title!  That is a wicked looking winch....</td>', 'Great title!  That is a wicked looking winch....', '2006-04-21 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333989, 322543, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would work better if the building were more centered. The building isn''t tilted, but I think the off-centeredness of it makes it look like it''s leaning to the right. It''s a weird optical illusion.</td>', 'This would work better if the building were more centered. The building isn''t tilted, but I think the off-centeredness of it makes it look like it''s leaning to the right. It''s a weird optical illusion.', '2006-04-21 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333993, 322387, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see less DOF, more clarity throughout, especially into the garden.</td>', 'I would like to see less DOF, more clarity throughout, especially into the garden.', '2006-04-21 22:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333995, 323177, 55642, '<td valign="top">Haha, you get points for originality while still sticking to the challenge theme!</td>', 'Haha, you get points for originality while still sticking to the challenge theme!', '2006-04-21 22:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334007, 320613, 52500, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  Perfect composition, the contrast between the rusty browns and the grey, the textures....all good.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  Perfect composition, the contrast between the rusty browns and the grey, the textures....all good.', '2006-04-21 22:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334008, 320858, 52500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I hope I look this good at 60!  You have captured the essence of old.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I hope I look this good at 60!  You have captured the essence of old.', '2006-04-21 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334009, 321899, 52500, '<td valign="top">I love a good abstract.  The colors, shapes, and textures here are fantastic.</td>', 'I love a good abstract.  The colors, shapes, and textures here are fantastic.', '2006-04-21 22:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334010, 321863, 14211, '<td valign="top">I have grown to love that house..the truck adds to that 40`s look.            Iwould like to visit it in person.</td>', 'I have grown to love that house..the truck adds to that 40`s look.            Iwould like to visit it in person.', '2006-04-21 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334015, 321597, 55642, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t make much sense of the photo, even if it was designed to squeeze it into a category where it clearly does not belong.</td>', 'The title doesn''t make much sense of the photo, even if it was designed to squeeze it into a category where it clearly does not belong.', '2006-04-21 22:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334023, 322847, 55642, '<td valign="top">With the advanced editing rules, I would prefer to see the power line cloned out.</td>', 'With the advanced editing rules, I would prefer to see the power line cloned out.', '2006-04-21 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334026, 322823, 35602, '<td valign="top">Overall, I didn''t like the photo.  It certainly meets the challenge, but the subject doesn''t do much for me.  Bone appears to be too orange, though the blanket is really cute.  It is also too centered.  Sharpness is good, though.</td>', 'Overall, I didn''t like the photo.  It certainly meets the challenge, but the subject doesn''t do much for me.  Bone appears to be too orange, though the blanket is really cute.  It is also too centered.  Sharpness is good, though.', '2006-04-21 22:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334028, 321374, 48245, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2006-04-21 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334034, 323215, 48245, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some nice potential subjects here but you just squared up the house without much compelling composition.</td>', 'There seems to be some nice potential subjects here but you just squared up the house without much compelling composition.', '2006-04-21 22:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334038, 322698, 48245, '<td valign="top">not sure the squared up composition works.</td>', 'not sure the squared up composition works.', '2006-04-21 22:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334040, 321719, 48245, '<td valign="top">oh my</td>', 'oh my', '2006-04-21 22:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334047, 321860, 48245, '<td valign="top">number of composition problems. You have the grass and treeline split at 50% and then you center up the hut. Shifting the camera to place the house in the lower right corner and setting the treeline at a rule of third would help this picture.</td>', 'number of composition problems. You have the grass and treeline split at 50% and then you center up the hut. Shifting the camera to place the house in the lower right corner and setting the treeline at a rule of third would help this picture.', '2006-04-21 22:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334050, 321592, 48245, '<td valign="top">tighter in would work better I think</td>', 'tighter in would work better I think', '2006-04-21 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334053, 321840, 48245, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice portrait...</td>', 'This is a really nice portrait...', '2006-04-21 22:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334055, 320971, 48245, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I like the flow.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I like the flow.', '2006-04-21 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334056, 321716, 48245, '<td valign="top">okay. This is cool.</td>', 'okay. This is cool.', '2006-04-21 22:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334065, 321622, 48245, '<td valign="top">I like the action and the composition.</td>', 'I like the action and the composition.', '2006-04-21 23:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334070, 322113, 48245, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2006-04-21 23:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334085, 322457, 55642, '<td valign="top">Now <i>this</i> is how to do "old" in a nature shot! There have been a lot of so-so landscapes of questionable theme suitability in this challenge.. but this tree looks like a bent old man and is actually fairly well shot. Not a ten, but it should still make you proud.</td>', 'Now this is how to do "old" in a nature shot! There have been a lot of so-so landscapes of questionable theme suitability in this challenge.. but this tree looks like a bent old man and is actually fairly well shot. Not a ten, but it should still make you proud.', '2006-04-21 23:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334124, 322113, 51556, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2006-04-21 23:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334142, 321223, 37961, '<td valign="top">This would have been a real winner had it been off set. Next time try not centering the window but have it over to the right or left if possible.<br/>The colors are good and the texture is really lovely.</td>', 'This would have been a real winner had it been off set. Next time try not centering the window but have it over to the right or left if possible.The colors are good and the texture is really lovely.', '2006-04-22 00:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334147, 320578, 51556, '<td valign="top">love the colors,not much older than the hill of this earth</td>', 'love the colors,not much older than the hill of this earth', '2006-04-22 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334165, 323039, 70, '<td valign="top">I think this is a gorgeous shot but it doesn''t work very well for me for this challenge topic.</td>', 'I think this is a gorgeous shot but it doesn''t work very well for me for this challenge topic.', '2006-04-22 00:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334167, 320595, 57151, '<td valign="top">I really like this one...visually interesting subject matter, great light, nice composition, and the DOF really makes the chair pop.  Good capture!</td>', 'I really like this one...visually interesting subject matter, great light, nice composition, and the DOF really makes the chair pop.  Good capture!', '2006-04-22 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334175, 321927, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here but the toning is just not doing it for me. Seems a bit too pinky, I think.</td>', 'I like the composition here but the toning is just not doing it for me. Seems a bit too pinky, I think.', '2006-04-22 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334176, 321632, 29013, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. need some processing, color cast , exposure( levels,curves) hue saturation.</td>', 'Love the composition. need some processing, color cast , exposure( levels,curves) hue saturation.', '2006-04-22 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
