(2334532, 322278, 31133, '<td valign="top">Cool looking biker guy - wish only that I could see more of his face, or that the shot could''ve been taken with a fill flash or from the other side. I know it''s not always possible to get this kind of shot in the light we want! It''s just to take it as best as you can when you get the chance, which is what you probably did. But the lighting would''ve improved my score. I really like the guy''s look and casual posture.</td>', 'Cool looking biker guy - wish only that I could see more of his face, or that the shot could''ve been taken with a fill flash or from the other side. I know it''s not always possible to get this kind of shot in the light we want! It''s just to take it as best as you can when you get the chance, which is what you probably did. But the lighting would''ve improved my score. I really like the guy''s look and casual posture.', '2006-04-22 05:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334533, 322113, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful wide angle - love those leading 1,2,3 lines! I''m not sure how I feel about the vignetting in the sky. It''s a nice framing effect, but maybe a bit too much in the upper right? Not sure. I''m crazy about the lower left, with those greens though!</td>', 'Beautiful wide angle - love those leading 1,2,3 lines! I''m not sure how I feel about the vignetting in the sky. It''s a nice framing effect, but maybe a bit too much in the upper right? Not sure. I''m crazy about the lower left, with those greens though!', '2006-04-22 05:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334534, 322100, 31133, '<td valign="top">This looks like there''s quite a bit of neat image, which I''m normally not crazy about - but in this case, it works really well! PERFECT lighting and impressive processing. You gave an ordinary lantern extra nice character.</td>', 'This looks like there''s quite a bit of neat image, which I''m normally not crazy about - but in this case, it works really well! PERFECT lighting and impressive processing. You gave an ordinary lantern extra nice character.', '2006-04-22 05:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
