(2334539, 321844, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the character of this image could be improved if the window weren''t so dead-center. Also, with a lift in contrast, I think this could be quite nice.</td>', 'I think the character of this image could be improved if the window weren''t so dead-center. Also, with a lift in contrast, I think this could be quite nice.', '2006-04-22 06:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
