(2334546, 322141, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes - bit abstract - age? Dunno.</td>', 'Nice shapes - bit abstract - age? Dunno.', '2006-04-22 06:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334547, 321784, 57229, '<td valign="top">I saw this one in the ''something new'' challenge - heh (probably not the same one, but that says something about the originality of the image)</td>', 'I saw this one in the ''something new'' challenge - heh (probably not the same one, but that says something about the originality of the image)', '2006-04-22 06:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334565, 321680, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the grinning ''teeth'' formed by the grille; gives it a nice rakish air, like a skull!  There is no apostrophe (sorry; I''m uncontrollably anal about apostrophes).  7.</td>', 'I like the grinning ''teeth'' formed by the grille; gives it a nice rakish air, like a skull!  There is no apostrophe (sorry; I''m uncontrollably anal about apostrophes).  7.', '2006-04-22 07:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334571, 322255, 30364, '<td valign="top">Cropping off part of the building makes the photograph so much more interesting.  Somehow it helps the viewer to look at the shack in the context of its environment.  Good decision.  7.</td>', 'Cropping off part of the building makes the photograph so much more interesting.  Somehow it helps the viewer to look at the shack in the context of its environment.  Good decision.  7.', '2006-04-22 07:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334575, 321374, 30364, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  Your decision to keep the contrast subtle is thoughtful  ... at first I thought it made the scene seem a little flat and two dimensional (with none of the revolting ''pop'' so beloved at DPC).  However, there''s a lovely tonal progression starting from the foreground arch, then the upper arch, the lower arch, and finally to the lower rear wall.  It establishes a pleasing gentle horizontal layering effect that would not have been possible with a high-contrast version.  Sympathetic treatment of colour - subtle again!  Title sucks, but I suppose you could hardly resist it.  8.</td>', 'An interesting image.  Your decision to keep the contrast subtle is thoughtful  ... at first I thought it made the scene seem a little flat and two dimensional (with none of the revolting ''pop'' so beloved at DPC).  However, there''s a lovely tonal progression starting from the foreground arch, then the upper arch, the lower arch, and finally to the lower rear wall.  It establishes a pleasing gentle horizontal layering effect that would not have been possible with a high-contrast version.  Sympathetic treatment of colour - subtle again!  Title sucks, but I suppose you could hardly resist it.  8.', '2006-04-22 07:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334590, 323190, 30364, '<td valign="top">A startling point-of-view, and very effective.  Interesting, too ... for people (including me) unfamiliar with the details of how these structures work, the foreground pole is a surprise.  I thought all the poles would be inside?  So the photograph not only looks good, it also stimulates thought.  That''s always a good thing.  7.</td>', 'A startling point-of-view, and very effective.  Interesting, too ... for people (including me) unfamiliar with the details of how these structures work, the foreground pole is a surprise.  I thought all the poles would be inside?  So the photograph not only looks good, it also stimulates thought.  That''s always a good thing.  7.', '2006-04-22 07:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334592, 322861, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very good, and made all the better by the wildly askew and shabby wooden shutters ... even the ''new'' additions are old!  Also pleasing that the man (the bust) apparently disapproves of the state of those shutters.  8.</td>', 'This is very good, and made all the better by the wildly askew and shabby wooden shutters ... even the ''new'' additions are old!  Also pleasing that the man (the bust) apparently disapproves of the state of those shutters.  8.', '2006-04-22 07:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334595, 321776, 30364, '<td valign="top">This has great charm.  The light and the subdued palette create an atmosphere of familiarity and gentle age.  7.</td>', 'This has great charm.  The light and the subdued palette create an atmosphere of familiarity and gentle age.  7.', '2006-04-22 07:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334596, 322475, 57229, '<td valign="top">Bit over-composed - but definitely old...</td>', 'Bit over-composed - but definitely old...', '2006-04-22 07:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334613, 322275, 30364, '<td valign="top">I nearly blew right by this, which would have been a mistake.  It''s a terrific, meticulous photograph of ... well, you said it: nothing!  And what a welcome change that is, amid so much leaden cliché.   I seldom have much interest in technical matters, but the tonal control here is really very nice; it gives the scene a lovely depth and atmosphere. And the apparent chaos is actually very cleverly and confidently resolved by a few leading lines, shapes and tones:  looks random, but it ain''t!  It''s a photograph with a lot more to offer than first appears.  9.</td>', 'I nearly blew right by this, which would have been a mistake.  It''s a terrific, meticulous photograph of ... well, you said it: nothing!  And what a welcome change that is, amid so much leaden cliché.   I seldom have much interest in technical matters, but the tonal control here is really very nice; it gives the scene a lovely depth and atmosphere. And the apparent chaos is actually very cleverly and confidently resolved by a few leading lines, shapes and tones:  looks random, but it ain''t!  It''s a photograph with a lot more to offer than first appears.  9.', '2006-04-22 08:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334614, 321255, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nice; it''s a photograph about the telephone, and not just a picture of a telephone.  So much more interesting!  7.</td>', 'This is nice; it''s a photograph about the telephone, and not just a picture of a telephone.  So much more interesting!  7.', '2006-04-22 08:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334623, 323225, 30364, '<td valign="top">The decision to include all the bland and muddy foreground was inspired; I''d have probably unthinkingly cropped it out and lost all the drama that you have achieved.  Presumably there''s a lot of dodge &amp; burn here, as well as some creative use of USM ... in which case this is a very fine (and rare) example of when heavy post-processing is justifiable.  Nice work!  8.</td>', 'The decision to include all the bland and muddy foreground was inspired; I''d have probably unthinkingly cropped it out and lost all the drama that you have achieved.  Presumably there''s a lot of dodge & burn here, as well as some creative use of USM ... in which case this is a very fine (and rare) example of when heavy post-processing is justifiable.  Nice work!  8.', '2006-04-22 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334625, 322662, 35804, '<td valign="top">There are so many things I enjoy about this image...the warm soft toning, the subtle lighting and the softness the shallow DOF brings to the image...a pretty still life for sure.</td>', 'There are so many things I enjoy about this image...the warm soft toning, the subtle lighting and the softness the shallow DOF brings to the image...a pretty still life for sure.', '2006-04-22 08:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334627, 321393, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great shot...and I love those chairs! Also the reflection of the red chair in the water really adds an amazing depth to this image...nicely done.</td>', 'Great shot...and I love those chairs! Also the reflection of the red chair in the water really adds an amazing depth to this image...nicely done.', '2006-04-22 08:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334628, 320595, 30364, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a collection of objects can have a profound meaning, and sometimes it''s just a random collection of stuff.  I''m not sure which one this is.  Either way, I like the light, and the fact that you aren''t afraid to let the highlights blow out a bit to get the effect you wanted.  7.</td>', 'Sometimes a collection of objects can have a profound meaning, and sometimes it''s just a random collection of stuff.  I''m not sure which one this is.  Either way, I like the light, and the fact that you aren''t afraid to let the highlights blow out a bit to get the effect you wanted.  7.', '2006-04-22 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334629, 322838, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really interesting photograph..it actually looks like a film image made with a Holga/Diana toy type of camera...again, interesting shot.</td>', 'A really interesting photograph..it actually looks like a film image made with a Holga/Diana toy type of camera...again, interesting shot.', '2006-04-22 08:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334631, 320899, 30364, '<td valign="top">Heavily-laboured title, but I like the photograph.  Very appealing and interesting shapes, tones and textures.  It does have a very complete, ''connected'' feel to it, so maybe the title was irresistible after all?  8.</td>', 'Heavily-laboured title, but I like the photograph.  Very appealing and interesting shapes, tones and textures.  It does have a very complete, ''connected'' feel to it, so maybe the title was irresistible after all?  8.', '2006-04-22 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
