(2334704, 322339, 31133, '<td valign="top">This wins the prize for world''s most perfect crop! The curtains are wonderful. My eye keeps going up to the chimney reflection in the background though, darn it. The bottom half of this is a 10 for me, top half only a 5 - guess I''ll split the difference and give you a 7.5 = 8 :-)</td>', 'This wins the prize for world''s most perfect crop! The curtains are wonderful. My eye keeps going up to the chimney reflection in the background though, darn it. The bottom half of this is a 10 for me, top half only a 5 - guess I''ll split the difference and give you a 7.5 = 8 :-)', '2006-04-22 10:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
