(2334823, 322810, 38496, '<td valign="top">I like the textures of the rock and the old wood, and the smattering of red bricks adds a bit of interest.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the textures of the rock and the old wood, and the smattering of red bricks adds a bit of interest.  Nice shot.', '2006-04-22 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334826, 320697, 38496, '<td valign="top">a little more contrast with the background might have made the dog''s face stand out a bit more.</td>', 'a little more contrast with the background might have made the dog''s face stand out a bit more.', '2006-04-22 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334828, 322969, 38496, '<td valign="top">cool texture on the beard</td>', 'cool texture on the beard', '2006-04-22 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334829, 320713, 38496, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the sepia on this.  I''d love to see the color, with the tress contrasting with the pillars.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the sepia on this.  I''d love to see the color, with the tress contrasting with the pillars.', '2006-04-22 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334832, 320888, 38496, '<td valign="top">kind of dark, but maybe that''s what you were intending?  I like the clouds.</td>', 'kind of dark, but maybe that''s what you were intending?  I like the clouds.', '2006-04-22 12:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334836, 321602, 38496, '<td valign="top">nice lighting on the white.  I might have cropped a bit tighter, but that''s just me.</td>', 'nice lighting on the white.  I might have cropped a bit tighter, but that''s just me.', '2006-04-22 12:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334837, 323049, 38496, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It''s simple and well composed.</td>', 'I like this.  It''s simple and well composed.', '2006-04-22 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
