(2334845, 321016, 38496, '<td valign="top">supposed to be in the portrait challenge?  Or just an old dress??</td>', 'supposed to be in the portrait challenge?  Or just an old dress??', '2006-04-22 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334862, 322784, 57151, '<td valign="top">This has too much jpeg artifacting (from overcompression) to make an accurate call as to the picture quality (look especially at the base of the vase and the cloth it sits on, as well as the background).  Try saving at a higher quality setting next time.</td>', 'This has too much jpeg artifacting (from overcompression) to make an accurate call as to the picture quality (look especially at the base of the vase and the cloth it sits on, as well as the background).  Try saving at a higher quality setting next time.', '2006-04-22 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334863, 322890, 57151, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  Whatever is reflecting the light back into his face is bringing out the modeling of his wrinkles really well, but i think that its reflection is a little too strong in his eyes, obscuring too much detail...otherwise I''d give this one a 9.  Nicely framed and well done overall for shooting in harsh midday light.</td>', 'Great subject!  Whatever is reflecting the light back into his face is bringing out the modeling of his wrinkles really well, but i think that its reflection is a little too strong in his eyes, obscuring too much detail...otherwise I''d give this one a 9.  Nicely framed and well done overall for shooting in harsh midday light.', '2006-04-22 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334867, 322154, 57151, '<td valign="top">Now that one''s got some personality!  I''d like to hear the story behind this character...</td>', 'Now that one''s got some personality!  I''d like to hear the story behind this character...', '2006-04-22 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334878, 322678, 57151, '<td valign="top">The blue terrycloth towel is reflecting unwanted color onto your subject, and it''s not covering the upper left corner of your image either.  Something white or more neutral would probably serve you better.</td>', 'The blue terrycloth towel is reflecting unwanted color onto your subject, and it''s not covering the upper left corner of your image either.  Something white or more neutral would probably serve you better.', '2006-04-22 13:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334886, 322216, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, surprisingly crisp considering the long exposure.  The only constructive thing I can offer is that I feel like the subject (the girl) should pop out of the image more than she does.  I think if the girl were more color and the background was more drab, she might stand out more.</td>', 'Cool shot, surprisingly crisp considering the long exposure.  The only constructive thing I can offer is that I feel like the subject (the girl) should pop out of the image more than she does.  I think if the girl were more color and the background was more drab, she might stand out more.', '2006-04-22 13:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334887, 321016, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge IMO.  The lighting might be a bit bright on the dress/legs, but looks perfect from the chest up.  Unfortunately the model looks a bit spaced out, which detracts from otherwise well shot image.</td>', 'Nice idea, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge IMO.  The lighting might be a bit bright on the dress/legs, but looks perfect from the chest up.  Unfortunately the model looks a bit spaced out, which detracts from otherwise well shot image.', '2006-04-22 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334891, 321926, 1, '<td valign="top">I find the background to be too distracting color-wise, due to his face appearing slightly desaturated.  Otherwise, great lighting, composoure, and focus.</td>', 'I find the background to be too distracting color-wise, due to his face appearing slightly desaturated.  Otherwise, great lighting, composoure, and focus.', '2006-04-22 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334894, 323200, 57151, '<td valign="top">whatever you did to those cotton swab looking needles looks very retouched...</td>', 'whatever you did to those cotton swab looking needles looks very retouched...', '2006-04-22 13:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334898, 322466, 1, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I loved this, the colors are so rich... but upon further investigation I don''t like that the top right and bottom left pieces are out of focus and the spot lighting seems a bit distracting.  Still the overall effect is great.</td>', 'At first glance, I loved this, the colors are so rich... but upon further investigation I don''t like that the top right and bottom left pieces are out of focus and the spot lighting seems a bit distracting.  Still the overall effect is great.', '2006-04-22 13:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
