(2335234, 323058, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. At first glance, I thought it looked oversaturated. Now, on closer inspection, it seems extra, but not over saturated - it''s kind of cool. The folded cloth with lint (I know the lint comment is picky -sorry!) is a little distracting. Would also like to see equally sharp focus on the camera body text as on the lens text. I like the colors reflected in the lens.</td>', 'This is interesting. At first glance, I thought it looked oversaturated. Now, on closer inspection, it seems extra, but not over saturated - it''s kind of cool. The folded cloth with lint (I know the lint comment is picky -sorry!) is a little distracting. Would also like to see equally sharp focus on the camera body text as on the lens text. I like the colors reflected in the lens.', '2006-04-22 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335237, 322578, 31133, '<td valign="top">The blur in the lower left and the long shadow lower right are a tad distracting, but this is such a gorgeous image that the distracting things are easily forgiven :-) I really like the orientation of the image and all the negative space.</td>', 'The blur in the lower left and the long shadow lower right are a tad distracting, but this is such a gorgeous image that the distracting things are easily forgiven :-) I really like the orientation of the image and all the negative space.', '2006-04-22 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335243, 322809, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. I think the light is either harsh or flat. I''m not that good with this stuff yet to be more specific, but can see that if the light were a little more dramatic or softer, this would be a winner.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. I think the light is either harsh or flat. I''m not that good with this stuff yet to be more specific, but can see that if the light were a little more dramatic or softer, this would be a winner.', '2006-04-22 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335246, 320699, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow - I want to know how you processed this! I would love to be able to make a picture like this, with this light. This inspires me incredibly.</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow - I want to know how you processed this! I would love to be able to make a picture like this, with this light. This inspires me incredibly.', '2006-04-22 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335249, 321050, 31133, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge topic, without a doubt. However, the focus and business detracts from all the interesting stuff this scene has to offer. Keep trying, and keep entering challenges! You''ve found a nice scene here.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge topic, without a doubt. However, the focus and business detracts from all the interesting stuff this scene has to offer. Keep trying, and keep entering challenges! You''ve found a nice scene here.', '2006-04-22 16:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335253, 322773, 31133, '<td valign="top">In this image, each separate subject is a winner by itself. For me, though, the fact that there are 3 main subjects (steps with statue, sky, and domed building) competes for my attention too much. I think any two of the elements alone would''ve been a winner, but not all three. You are a master at processing! This is really an amazing and good job technically.</td>', 'In this image, each separate subject is a winner by itself. For me, though, the fact that there are 3 main subjects (steps with statue, sky, and domed building) competes for my attention too much. I think any two of the elements alone would''ve been a winner, but not all three. You are a master at processing! This is really an amazing and good job technically.', '2006-04-22 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335255, 322685, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wish this little bug were bigger, even if it is a bug''s view :-)</td>', 'Ah, I wish this little bug were bigger, even if it is a bug''s view :-)', '2006-04-22 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335258, 322473, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dress - what a great heirloom. I''d love to see a soft light on the dress, so the pretty details could come out more. A different background might work, too. The dress is sweet.</td>', 'Beautiful dress - what a great heirloom. I''d love to see a soft light on the dress, so the pretty details could come out more. A different background might work, too. The dress is sweet.', '2006-04-22 16:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
