(2335565, 320613, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in colors.  Good choice of viewpoint in your composition.  Good clarity and focus.  Not sure that it has the "Wow" factor, but it''s a fun to look at image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice contrast in colors.  Good choice of viewpoint in your composition.  Good clarity and focus.  Not sure that it has the "Wow" factor, but it''s a fun to look at image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-22 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335566, 322759, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and well composed.  Only drawback for me is the image is pretty soft.  There is lot''s of wonderful texture available here that would really pop with a nice crisp image.</td>', 'Very interesting subject and well composed.  Only drawback for me is the image is pretty soft.  There is lot''s of wonderful texture available here that would really pop with a nice crisp image.', '2006-04-22 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335570, 323167, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good subject for this challenge.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten more elevated to separate the equipment from the background a little more.  Maybe even a low, close from the corner type shot?  The horizon really cuts this image in half is what I''m trying to say I guess.  ;^)</td>', 'Good subject for this challenge.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten more elevated to separate the equipment from the background a little more.  Maybe even a low, close from the corner type shot?  The horizon really cuts this image in half is what I''m trying to say I guess.  ;^)', '2006-04-22 21:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335573, 323201, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice find. Well composed with the low angle.  The background works well for it.  Should do well with this in the challenge.  Good luck!  ;^)</td>', 'Very nice find. Well composed with the low angle.  The background works well for it.  Should do well with this in the challenge.  Good luck!  ;^)', '2006-04-22 21:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335577, 323031, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat looking place.  This photo is OK, a little bit documentary.  I''d bet there is another angle that could work with this subject to get a little more artistic?</td>', 'Neat looking place.  This photo is OK, a little bit documentary.  I''d bet there is another angle that could work with this subject to get a little more artistic?', '2006-04-22 21:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335578, 321413, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, old, nice colors...I like it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Simple, old, nice colors...I like it.  Good luck!', '2006-04-22 21:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335585, 322232, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting here.  This has very nice texture and feel to it.  The lighting helps with strong contrast.  Being on a relatively flat plane you''ve gotten well distributed DOF and clarity throughout.  Borders are a take it or leave it for many people - in this case a border might help set some boundaries...not sure.  (Just thinking out loud).  ;^)<br/> <br/>Nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting here.  This has very nice texture and feel to it.  The lighting helps with strong contrast.  Being on a relatively flat plane you''ve gotten well distributed DOF and clarity throughout.  Borders are a take it or leave it for many people - in this case a border might help set some boundaries...not sure.  (Just thinking out loud).  ;^) Nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-22 21:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335674, 323038, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its a great pic, but the title needs work.</td>', 'Its a great pic, but the title needs work.', '2006-04-22 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
