(2335849, 320090, 55394, '<td valign="top">I really like this, i am no expert, but the clarity of the watch and combined with the patterns and colours of the background makes a great combination, well done 10 from me, the best i''ve seen so far. Puts my entry to shame!! <br/>I''ve now voted on every submission, and i still think yours is the best, theres some really good entries but this stands out. Congratulations, if you don''t get at least top ten... (preferably first) i''ll be arguing!</td>', 'I really like this, i am no expert, but the clarity of the watch and combined with the patterns and colours of the background makes a great combination, well done 10 from me, the best i''ve seen so far. Puts my entry to shame!! I''ve now voted on every submission, and i still think yours is the best, theres some really good entries but this stands out. Congratulations, if you don''t get at least top ten... (preferably first) i''ll be arguing!', '2006-04-23 00:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
