(2336059, 322773, 34938, '<td valign="top">wonderful sky...not sure that the shot has a wow factor about the subject which is the building, once you see the sky, the rest is quite bland...perhaps another perspective or better still a low shot of the building with the domes, looking up to that amazing sky would have been better</td>', 'wonderful sky...not sure that the shot has a wow factor about the subject which is the building, once you see the sky, the rest is quite bland...perhaps another perspective or better still a low shot of the building with the domes, looking up to that amazing sky would have been better', '2006-04-23 04:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
