(2336068, 322820, 34938, '<td valign="top">great edit, but I find the chopped off fence at the bottom distracting...perhaps if you positioned yourself so that little path led to a view of the windmill, it would have made a more interesting composition...I am not really one for ''in the centre'' compositions unless it is warrented, but that''s just me. the sky looks good, and the sheep add to the shot as well</td>', 'great edit, but I find the chopped off fence at the bottom distracting...perhaps if you positioned yourself so that little path led to a view of the windmill, it would have made a more interesting composition...I am not really one for ''in the centre'' compositions unless it is warrented, but that''s just me. the sky looks good, and the sheep add to the shot as well', '2006-04-23 04:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
