(2336163, 322978, 44611, '<td valign="top">Just a bit of dodging and burning?  A great effect, but I''m not convinced that the house is actually very old.</td>', 'Just a bit of dodging and burning?  A great effect, but I''m not convinced that the house is actually very old.', '2006-04-23 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
