(2336195, 321005, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I really don''t get your connection with ''something old'' here.  That looks like teenager at the window, which appears to have an aluminium frame, so not old at all.  That said, it''s an interesting picture with good composition which depicts a feeling of desperation.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I really don''t get your connection with ''something old'' here.  That looks like teenager at the window, which appears to have an aluminium frame, so not old at all.  That said, it''s an interesting picture with good composition which depicts a feeling of desperation.', '2006-04-23 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336196, 322988, 40133, '<td valign="top">Creepy! :-)</td>', 'Creepy! :-)', '2006-04-23 09:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
