(2336202, 322898, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely cabin right in the woods, I think I could happily live there.  Sadly the exposure on your image is way too bright to show it to it''s best advantage.  Maybe try taking the shot at a different time of day or use a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Lovely cabin right in the woods, I think I could happily live there.  Sadly the exposure on your image is way too bright to show it to it''s best advantage.  Maybe try taking the shot at a different time of day or use a smaller aperture.', '2006-04-23 09:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336209, 322208, 44611, '<td valign="top">Phillips screws - mmmmnn, not sure that they really qualify as old (first manufactured in 1936) but then old is relative.  <br/> <br/>Aside from that, a good sharp image although it focuses significantly more on the latch than on the fence - and I''m sure that latch design is older than Phillips screws.  I like the sepia treatment, it works with this subject.</td>', 'Phillips screws - mmmmnn, not sure that they really qualify as old (first manufactured in 1936) but then old is relative.   Aside from that, a good sharp image although it focuses significantly more on the latch than on the fence - and I''m sure that latch design is older than Phillips screws.  I like the sepia treatment, it works with this subject.', '2006-04-23 09:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336210, 322100, 44611, '<td valign="top">Or a replica, regularly on sale down the market for about a fiver!  Nice treatment though, I like the simplicity of the image.  Just not sure this is real authenticated old stuff.</td>', 'Or a replica, regularly on sale down the market for about a fiver!  Nice treatment though, I like the simplicity of the image.  Just not sure this is real authenticated old stuff.', '2006-04-23 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336213, 321784, 44611, '<td valign="top">It''s really weird but there''s one of these in the ''Something New'' challenge too.  That makes me one mighty confused little bunny right now! <br/> <br/>Great shot, good composition and dof and I love the touch, just the slightest hint of colour from the background, that simple thing really makes this image very special.  <br/> <br/>Oh, and on balance, I think dandelion heads must be ''Something Old'' since this is the stage <i>after</i> they''ve flowered and lost their petals.</td>', 'It''s really weird but there''s one of these in the ''Something New'' challenge too.  That makes me one mighty confused little bunny right now!  Great shot, good composition and dof and I love the touch, just the slightest hint of colour from the background, that simple thing really makes this image very special.   Oh, and on balance, I think dandelion heads must be ''Something Old'' since this is the stage after they''ve flowered and lost their petals.', '2006-04-23 09:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336214, 322413, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2006-04-23 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336220, 323028, 44611, '<td valign="top">I know a couple of 78 year-olds who might tan your hide for calling them old!  <br/> <br/>And, I''m sorry, 78 years for a bridge just is not old.  There are two within walking distance of my home which are well over 600 years old.<br/> <br/>Composition is good, but your exposure is a bit bright so you''ve lost contrast between your colours.  Try taking the photo at a different time of day to see how dawn or dusk light affects the picture.</td>', 'I know a couple of 78 year-olds who might tan your hide for calling them old!   And, I''m sorry, 78 years for a bridge just is not old.  There are two within walking distance of my home which are well over 600 years old. Composition is good, but your exposure is a bit bright so you''ve lost contrast between your colours.  Try taking the photo at a different time of day to see how dawn or dusk light affects the picture.', '2006-04-23 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336289, 321010, 29440, '<td valign="top">Your perspective is very good as well as your subject.  There is a lack of detail, I think, by not having it in color.  It also looks like the center of the photo is in focus, but near and far are slightly out of focus.  Best of scores.</td>', 'Your perspective is very good as well as your subject.  There is a lack of detail, I think, by not having it in color.  It also looks like the center of the photo is in focus, but near and far are slightly out of focus.  Best of scores.', '2006-04-23 11:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
