(2338596, 321840, 48954, '<td valign="top">wait...huh? are the two same pictures here? I though i already left a comment on this one....the lighting seems different...<br/> <br/> <br/>Ok, no i was wrong. Damn, with all of this studying for exams i must be loosing it.<br/> <br/>To the point: i thought i recall leaving a message saying the following:<br/> <br/>Great texture but the lighting in the top left is a little to harsh and makes the eyes very dark. it would have been nice to see more of her eyes. good work though<br/> <br/> <br/>The next day: ok, nooow i get it. There is a similar picture of this women on the portrait challenge, that''s why I got all confused.</td>', 'wait...huh? are the two same pictures here? I though i already left a comment on this one....the lighting seems different...  Ok, no i was wrong. Damn, with all of this studying for exams i must be loosing it. To the point: i thought i recall leaving a message saying the following: Great texture but the lighting in the top left is a little to harsh and makes the eyes very dark. it would have been nice to see more of her eyes. good work though  The next day: ok, nooow i get it. There is a similar picture of this women on the portrait challenge, that''s why I got all confused.', '2006-04-24 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
