(2339524, 323047, 7322, '<td valign="top">Why is that one kid grinning ear to ear? This is bizarre. The overly smooth quality makes it even stranger. I can''t tell if I like it or not which is a good thing in a way. It''s very surreal.</td>', 'Why is that one kid grinning ear to ear? This is bizarre. The overly smooth quality makes it even stranger. I can''t tell if I like it or not which is a good thing in a way. It''s very surreal.', '2006-04-24 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339552, 321600, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the set up feels a little stark - too "producty."</td>', 'Nice idea but the set up feels a little stark - too "producty."', '2006-04-24 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339560, 321917, 70, '<td valign="top">Good subject but with a few issues. The horizon seems to be quite tilted to the left. The remaining bits of orange in the sky, especially the large portion right about the house, are somewhat distracting. Otherwise nicely done, though.</td>', 'Good subject but with a few issues. The horizon seems to be quite tilted to the left. The remaining bits of orange in the sky, especially the large portion right about the house, are somewhat distracting. Otherwise nicely done, though.', '2006-04-24 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
