(2339570, 320541, 70, '<td valign="top">The piano is nice but the corner in the bottom left is distracting, as is the fact that the lantern tops have been cut off. Looks like it was taken through glass - is this an exhibit of some sort?</td>', 'The piano is nice but the corner in the bottom left is distracting, as is the fact that the lantern tops have been cut off. Looks like it was taken through glass - is this an exhibit of some sort?', '2006-04-24 15:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
