(2339592, 320394, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the idea. A great DOF would have helped so that the camera and the photog are in focus. Seems a bit overexposed.</td>', 'I like the composition and the idea. A great DOF would have helped so that the camera and the photog are in focus. Seems a bit overexposed.', '2006-04-24 15:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339665, 321632, 45672, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  The photo is a little dark, but the content is awesome.  I wonder if you could lighten this up a little using a levels adjustment layer in photoshop.  Maybe you were going for the dark look.  Anyway, nice going.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  The photo is a little dark, but the content is awesome.  I wonder if you could lighten this up a little using a levels adjustment layer in photoshop.  Maybe you were going for the dark look.  Anyway, nice going.', '2006-04-24 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
