(2339668, 321301, 45672, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  This is a great composition.  I am little turned off by the processed look, but at the same time it really dramatizes the image.  Good shooting!</td>', 'Awesome shot.  This is a great composition.  I am little turned off by the processed look, but at the same time it really dramatizes the image.  Good shooting!', '2006-04-24 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
