(2339674, 323028, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool bridge.  I think you might have had some luck trying to add some contrast and saturate some of the greens using photoshop.  Composition is pretty good though.</td>', 'Cool bridge.  I think you might have had some luck trying to add some contrast and saturate some of the greens using photoshop.  Composition is pretty good though.', '2006-04-24 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339681, 322112, 45672, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, it looks like there is a ton of noise on this image or you tried to upsize from a smaller picture.  Anyway, don''t take this personally, but it looks pretty bad.  The picture appears to be a good shot though.</td>', 'Hmmmm, it looks like there is a ton of noise on this image or you tried to upsize from a smaller picture.  Anyway, don''t take this personally, but it looks pretty bad.  The picture appears to be a good shot though.', '2006-04-24 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
