(2339756, 321863, 50389, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The colours work for me ad the contrast is good. I am not sure that the house looks very old but i guess that is being picky.</td>', 'I really like this. The colours work for me ad the contrast is good. I am not sure that the house looks very old but i guess that is being picky.', '2006-04-24 17:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
