(2341678, 321472, 57480, '<td valign="top">I am a greenhorn. My opinion barely must be taken into account. I even invented my own voting system which everybody is free to criticize:<br/>10- exceptional good. Real art.<br/>9- better than commercial print. Between art and comercial print<br/>8- could be a good commercial print<br/>7- fair commercial print<br/>6- ordinary snapshot, good technic<br/>5- ordinary snapshot<br/>4- ordinary snapshot, poor technic<br/>3- no subject but good technic (colors, focus)<br/>2- no subject, fair technic<br/>1- no subject, no technic, no meaning<br/> <br/>I rated this 9 just because of the background. But I think the foreground is fantastic.</td>', 'I am a greenhorn. My opinion barely must be taken into account. I even invented my own voting system which everybody is free to criticize:10- exceptional good. Real art.9- better than commercial print. Between art and comercial print8- could be a good commercial print7- fair commercial print6- ordinary snapshot, good technic5- ordinary snapshot4- ordinary snapshot, poor technic3- no subject but good technic (colors, focus)2- no subject, fair technic1- no subject, no technic, no meaning I rated this 9 just because of the background. But I think the foreground is fantastic.', '2006-04-25 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
