(2342100, 322978, 48339, '<td valign="top">well done. a little ''flat'' though.  i mean there''s no depth at all.  like a ''mug shot'' at the cop shop. "ok, now turn to the right"</td>', 'well done. a little ''flat'' though.  i mean there''s no depth at all.  like a ''mug shot'' at the cop shop. "ok, now turn to the right"', '2006-04-25 13:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342102, 323125, 37719, '<td valign="top">A lot of interesting things going on here...almost too busy with the reflections and changes in depth across the image.  I start out looking at your subject but very quickly wander to the background.  Looking at it a few more minutes I find myself looking through your subject and around it bypassing your subject altogether.  The wheel seems a bit dark.  The rust can handle this.  But perhaps if the wheel was a little brighter to get more detail of the surface as well as making that yellow stand out a bit more may have helped to keep the subject the point of focus.</td>', 'A lot of interesting things going on here...almost too busy with the reflections and changes in depth across the image.  I start out looking at your subject but very quickly wander to the background.  Looking at it a few more minutes I find myself looking through your subject and around it bypassing your subject altogether.  The wheel seems a bit dark.  The rust can handle this.  But perhaps if the wheel was a little brighter to get more detail of the surface as well as making that yellow stand out a bit more may have helped to keep the subject the point of focus.', '2006-04-25 13:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342104, 322566, 48339, '<td valign="top">should have maybe not done so much burning. the water looks too blue and i can see your burn markings.</td>', 'should have maybe not done so much burning. the water looks too blue and i can see your burn markings.', '2006-04-25 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342108, 320713, 29486, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like enough contrast</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like enough contrast', '2006-04-25 13:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342113, 320606, 48339, '<td valign="top">awesome. my favorite. super location. just a hair dark, but it''s probably my monitor. and the background distracts me from the old building, but i don''t care.  i like snow and mountains.</td>', 'awesome. my favorite. super location. just a hair dark, but it''s probably my monitor. and the background distracts me from the old building, but i don''t care.  i like snow and mountains.', '2006-04-25 13:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342114, 322907, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice detail overall. Wouldn''t mind seeing more of the watermill''s surroundings such as more of the tree on the right and more of the entry to the door. Usually i find myself wanting the photographer to crop tighter for a closer look, this one just happens to be opposite. Because of the fine focus you could afford more background with this neat watermill as your subject, it may help the "leaning back" quality of the mill also.</td>', 'Nice detail overall. Wouldn''t mind seeing more of the watermill''s surroundings such as more of the tree on the right and more of the entry to the door. Usually i find myself wanting the photographer to crop tighter for a closer look, this one just happens to be opposite. Because of the fine focus you could afford more background with this neat watermill as your subject, it may help the "leaning back" quality of the mill also.', '2006-04-25 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342120, 321904, 48339, '<td valign="top">love the crush.  could use a little help with the angle of things though, maybe i dunno.</td>', 'love the crush.  could use a little help with the angle of things though, maybe i dunno.', '2006-04-25 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342121, 321904, 40370, '<td valign="top">Old bottles often have unusual shapes, next time maybe you could incorporate the whole bottle into your composition. I do like the old dusty feel in this image.</td>', 'Old bottles often have unusual shapes, next time maybe you could incorporate the whole bottle into your composition. I do like the old dusty feel in this image.', '2006-04-25 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342125, 323215, 40370, '<td valign="top">The tree growing from the inside is classic. The bottom of the image seems cropped a bit tight but you shot from a great POV.</td>', 'The tree growing from the inside is classic. The bottom of the image seems cropped a bit tight but you shot from a great POV.', '2006-04-25 13:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342130, 322424, 48339, '<td valign="top">at least you didn''t title it ''old tree''  nice shot. nice perspective. and i can tell it''s old without any help. the one ''strong'' cloud in the upper left is distracting.</td>', 'at least you didn''t title it ''old tree''  nice shot. nice perspective. and i can tell it''s old without any help. the one ''strong'' cloud in the upper left is distracting.', '2006-04-25 13:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342135, 323145, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wish this image was bigger and the train would definitely still show it''s age even if the colors weren''t desaturated. Nice concept.</td>', 'Wish this image was bigger and the train would definitely still show it''s age even if the colors weren''t desaturated. Nice concept.', '2006-04-25 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342142, 321393, 40370, '<td valign="top">Standard 1950''s garden accessories, nice coloring edit.</td>', 'Standard 1950''s garden accessories, nice coloring edit.', '2006-04-25 13:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342143, 322525, 48339, '<td valign="top">could equally use some darkness in the sky to balance things out a little.  the eye gets ''trapped'' on the building and takes away from the overall composition.  nice job.  keep up the good work.</td>', 'could equally use some darkness in the sky to balance things out a little.  the eye gets ''trapped'' on the building and takes away from the overall composition.  nice job.  keep up the good work.', '2006-04-25 13:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
