(2342269, 320899, 56735, '<td valign="top">Wow, boss! Your pic is simply sensational. Mesmerizing and hypnotizing and is perhaps, better than many pics, taken by the great photographer, Henri Cartier Bresson. Hats off to you, and hats of to the great Bresson, without whom, the world of photography could have been quite different. <br/> <br/>This pic is a time-machine, and will take you back to the past, but, however, was there any chance, to avoid the disturbing elements to the left of the pic, which is, perhaps a distant building?<br/> <br/>My best wishes are always for you. <br/> <br/> <br/>Stay well, and do continue this great work,<br/> <br/>Soham [India]<br/>Soham.gupta@gmail.com</td>', 'Wow, boss! Your pic is simply sensational. Mesmerizing and hypnotizing and is perhaps, better than many pics, taken by the great photographer, Henri Cartier Bresson. Hats off to you, and hats of to the great Bresson, without whom, the world of photography could have been quite different.  This pic is a time-machine, and will take you back to the past, but, however, was there any chance, to avoid the disturbing elements to the left of the pic, which is, perhaps a distant building? My best wishes are always for you.   Stay well, and do continue this great work, Soham [India]Soham.gupta@gmail.com', '2006-04-25 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
