(2343839, 322759, 3419, '<td valign="top">I would prefer that the window was straight vertically, and included more of the top frame, without losing any of the rock at the bottom. Focus needs to be more sharp across the whole photo. The rocks and bottom of the window frame look a little soft, whereas the rocks in the top left look sharp. Border detracts rather than enhances. Nice colors, and nice choice of subject. The  reflection in the window adds interest.</td>', 'I would prefer that the window was straight vertically, and included more of the top frame, without losing any of the rock at the bottom. Focus needs to be more sharp across the whole photo. The rocks and bottom of the window frame look a little soft, whereas the rocks in the top left look sharp. Border detracts rather than enhances. Nice colors, and nice choice of subject. The  reflection in the window adds interest.', '2006-04-26 00:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2343840, 322114, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle light and great clarity...plus a cool truck...very nice.</td>', 'Nice subtle light and great clarity...plus a cool truck...very nice.', '2006-04-26 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
