(2344664, 322154, 42792, '<td valign="top">Expected to see this score higher.  I guess only Asians will really connect with this photo and its treatment.  Still find it a superb image despite some minor issues.  It''s like subject and background have merged together to be frozen in time.  Even the faded stairs at the back seem to say something like it''s an exit of some kind.  Adding this to my favourites.</td>', 'Expected to see this score higher.  I guess only Asians will really connect with this photo and its treatment.  Still find it a superb image despite some minor issues.  It''s like subject and background have merged together to be frozen in time.  Even the faded stairs at the back seem to say something like it''s an exit of some kind.  Adding this to my favourites.', '2006-04-26 05:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
