(2344808, 322969, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, a 6.733 and you didn´t even make a top 4 spot on our team.  Talk about the Magnificent 7 having a good week!  :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the top 10 placing, could have gone even higher if it were not for the Kapluggin couple...</td>', 'Wow, a 6.733 and you didn´t even make a top 4 spot on our team.  Talk about the Magnificent 7 having a good week!  :) Congrats on the top 10 placing, could have gone even higher if it were not for the Kapluggin couple...', '2006-04-26 06:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
