(2344849, 321211, 27431, '<td valign="top">As has been pointed out before, I think a little more attention to detail would have gone a long way to helping this image score better. While I like the concept, you could have hidden the light in the jaw a bit more, and the softness of a main subject, in this case the skull, is a score killer every time.<br/> <br/>As far as the DNMC, well, that happens, don''t let it deter you.<br/> <br/>9.35 for concept, 4.95 for execution!<br/> <br/>Wow...2 death references in one comment about a skull, that slays me!!!</td>', 'As has been pointed out before, I think a little more attention to detail would have gone a long way to helping this image score better. While I like the concept, you could have hidden the light in the jaw a bit more, and the softness of a main subject, in this case the skull, is a score killer every time. As far as the DNMC, well, that happens, don''t let it deter you. 9.35 for concept, 4.95 for execution! Wow...2 death references in one comment about a skull, that slays me!!!', '2006-04-26 06:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2344855, 321196, 37334, '<td valign="top">Thanks Amanda;) That''s the sort of comment that makes it all worth it.</td>', 'Thanks Amanda;) That''s the sort of comment that makes it all worth it.', '2006-04-26 06:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2344912, 323166, 31403, '<td valign="top">People who see phalic here are seriously skewed - maybe it''s the first time she''s seen a banana?<br/> <br/>This is a nice shot - I hate that the fact that when people think you didn''t meet the challenge it relegates you to the last page.  This shot has nice lighting, great focus - I like it.<br/> <br/>Technically a very nice photo, I would have given you the benefit of the doubt on subject - I think you would have ended up 7-8 in my voting, FWIW.  :)<br/></td>', 'People who see phalic here are seriously skewed - maybe it''s the first time she''s seen a banana? This is a nice shot - I hate that the fact that when people think you didn''t meet the challenge it relegates you to the last page.  This shot has nice lighting, great focus - I like it. Technically a very nice photo, I would have given you the benefit of the doubt on subject - I think you would have ended up 7-8 in my voting, FWIW.  :)', '2006-04-26 06:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
