(2345776, 321632, 30612, '<td valign="top">Hi everyone,<br/> <br/>Thank you for the feedback. I didn''t expect the picture to do very well because I thought that there were other subjects that fit the challenge better, but at the time I was in the Gambia for work, and I took this picture while I was there. I like the picture, and I wanted some feedback on composition etc., which you have provided, so thanks again. This is my first picture submitted on DP challenge and I would like to start submitting regularly. I don''t know the first thing about photoshop editing :( so that is one thing I have to start learning about.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi everyone, Thank you for the feedback. I didn''t expect the picture to do very well because I thought that there were other subjects that fit the challenge better, but at the time I was in the Gambia for work, and I took this picture while I was there. I like the picture, and I wanted some feedback on composition etc., which you have provided, so thanks again. This is my first picture submitted on DP challenge and I would like to start submitting regularly. I don''t know the first thing about photoshop editing :( so that is one thing I have to start learning about. ', '2006-04-26 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
