(2346705, 321008, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice image and I soooo would love to have that Jeep. Problem is the voters were looking for images that looked old. As was discussed in a thread about a 30 y/o camera.<br/> <br/>It''s a well done car shot, but lacks a bit of punch as far as what voters want to see around here. BTW, I think the quality is good enough for almost any car magazine.<br/> <br/>IMO, I think it would have scored a bit higher in the Something New challenge with a title such as "1947 Willys Jeep Made New".</td>', 'Nice image and I soooo would love to have that Jeep. Problem is the voters were looking for images that looked old. As was discussed in a thread about a 30 y/o camera. It''s a well done car shot, but lacks a bit of punch as far as what voters want to see around here. BTW, I think the quality is good enough for almost any car magazine. IMO, I think it would have scored a bit higher in the Something New challenge with a title such as "1947 Willys Jeep Made New".', '2006-04-26 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2346851, 321776, 32997, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful...would like to sit and read a book over a cup of coffee there..<br/>love that you have evoked such a strong emotional moment with this shot..</td>', 'this is beautiful...would like to sit and read a book over a cup of coffee there..love that you have evoked such a strong emotional moment with this shot..', '2006-04-26 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2346874, 322405, 32997, '<td valign="top">ok I didn''t vote on this challenge...but I don''t for a moment understand how this isn''t above the 6 mark...<br/>what is the thought process? needs to be closer? different angle? why???? so it can look like someone else''s work? ahhhhhhhhhhhhh!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/>this is excellent and fits the challenge perfectly..congrats on the great work...</td>', 'ok I didn''t vote on this challenge...but I don''t for a moment understand how this isn''t above the 6 mark...what is the thought process? needs to be closer? different angle? why???? so it can look like someone else''s work? ahhhhhhhhhhhhh!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!this is excellent and fits the challenge perfectly..congrats on the great work...', '2006-04-26 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 0),
