(2351629, 321943, 22492, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thank you for your comments everyone!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> the lens has a nice bokeh</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hotpasta - what is a bokeh??<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by efren:</b></div><hr/><i> remove the color cast</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>efren - what do you mean by that?  ...Change the white balance or the color profile??</td>', 'Thank you for your comments everyone! Originally posted by hotpasta: the lens has a nice bokeh  hotpasta - what is a bokeh?? Originally posted by efren: remove the color cast  efren - what do you mean by that?  ...Change the white balance or the color profile??', '2006-04-27 20:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
