(2362902, 322418, 36065, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed capture, althought I wish it was larger.  It looks like you had a hundred pixels or so to spare.  I also think a slight curves adjustment would have really made the rust jump out.  Well seen.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed capture, althought I wish it was larger.  It looks like you had a hundred pixels or so to spare.  I also think a slight curves adjustment would have really made the rust jump out.  Well seen.', '2006-04-30 15:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
