(2364274, 321301, 14414, '<td valign="top"><i>Sorry, this is gonna be a stream of random thoughts rather than anything proper. Struggling to catch up last entries before rollover. Will be better next week :)</i> <br/> <br/>I really like the grungy atmosphere, suits the subject well (although there is a danger now of it being done too often). The vignetting works well with this style, and the colours are nice and rich.<br/> <br/>However, the teddy itself doesnt'' really look that old or abandoned, partly ''cause of the lighting/dodging. Maybe if it were hanging off the end of the bench of something...not sure. Maybe just a bit darker (the teddy not the picture) and it would work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sorry, this is gonna be a stream of random thoughts rather than anything proper. Struggling to catch up last entries before rollover. Will be better next week :)  I really like the grungy atmosphere, suits the subject well (although there is a danger now of it being done too often). The vignetting works well with this style, and the colours are nice and rich. However, the teddy itself doesnt'' really look that old or abandoned, partly ''cause of the lighting/dodging. Maybe if it were hanging off the end of the bench of something...not sure. Maybe just a bit darker (the teddy not the picture) and it would work. ', '2006-04-30 19:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
