(2370583, 321776, 22734, '<td valign="top">Gary: you are indeed a potent force. A master at excecuting your ideas. It is like you have the very pulse of the voters to entertain them with amazing and creative images with impeccable technique, but above it all, it is your creativity that shines. Like the man with the golden touch. Here, you revert to simplicity but mange to bring the essence of the old in most warm and charming manner.<br/> <br/>Sir, you deserve all the praise that comes your way. Congratulations on your Red.</td>', 'Gary: you are indeed a potent force. A master at excecuting your ideas. It is like you have the very pulse of the voters to entertain them with amazing and creative images with impeccable technique, but above it all, it is your creativity that shines. Like the man with the golden touch. Here, you revert to simplicity but mange to bring the essence of the old in most warm and charming manner. Sir, you deserve all the praise that comes your way. Congratulations on your Red.', '2006-05-02 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
