(2385987, 323046, 30454, '<td valign="top">OJ Greatings from your own Critique Club. You didn''t have any entry last week, so I am commenting on this one.<br/> <br/>Here is what I like about the image.<br/> <br/>- Composition<br/>- Expressions<br/> <br/>Here some things needs improvement IMO<br/> <br/>- Picture is too sharp. <br/>- There are some blown outs on the forehead and the face.<br/>- Most important of all - DNMC (Does not Meet the Challenge). You will see this trend on DPC. You will get low score for DNMC.<br/> <br/>Best of luck for your future entries.</td>', 'OJ Greatings from your own Critique Club. You didn''t have any entry last week, so I am commenting on this one. Here is what I like about the image. - Composition- Expressions Here some things needs improvement IMO - Picture is too sharp. - There are some blown outs on the forehead and the face.- Most important of all - DNMC (Does not Meet the Challenge). You will see this trend on DPC. You will get low score for DNMC. Best of luck for your future entries.', '2006-05-05 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 0),
