(2404394, 323034, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>From the CTP MkII</b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> 6. It''s low-key. I love low-key. Low-key rocks.<br/><b>Composition:</b> 8. I don''t think I''d have it any other way.<br/><b>Subject:</b> 5. Personally, I''m not too wild over "camera" photos. Also, yeah, I know it''s old, but it doesn''t look old. So maybe that''s what pulled your score down. DPC-folk tend to look for the obvious when voting in challenges.<br/><b>Technical:</b> 8. Whatever you did, you did right. No complaints.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> As to the way you shot the photo, nothing. Well, maybe minor nitpicks but nothing too important. As to your score, I guess you shoulda included a nude girl or explosions or a flower in the composition. <b>That</b> would be received well by the voters.<br/><b>Summary:</b> Yeah, I too guess you didn''t deserve that score. I wish I could bump the score I gave you up... just to compensate.<br/> <br/><b>Disclaimer:</b> <i>The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p</i> <br/> <br/><i>Edit: Coding. Hehe.</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-10 23:18:36.</i></td>', 'From the CTP MkII  First Impression: 6. It''s low-key. I love low-key. Low-key rocks.Composition: 8. I don''t think I''d have it any other way.Subject: 5. Personally, I''m not too wild over "camera" photos. Also, yeah, I know it''s old, but it doesn''t look old. So maybe that''s what pulled your score down. DPC-folk tend to look for the obvious when voting in challenges.Technical: 8. Whatever you did, you did right. No complaints.Improvement: As to the way you shot the photo, nothing. Well, maybe minor nitpicks but nothing too important. As to your score, I guess you shoulda included a nude girl or explosions or a flower in the composition. That would be received well by the voters.Summary: Yeah, I too guess you didn''t deserve that score. I wish I could bump the score I gave you up... just to compensate. Disclaimer: The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p  Edit: Coding. Hehe.', '2006-05-11 00:17:49.000000', '2006-05-11 00:18:36.000000', 0),
(2405183, 322473, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>From the CTP MkII</b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> Product shot!;p If it was, I''d buy one. 6.<br/><b>Composition:</b> 5. It''s pretty square, and square doesn''t do your subject justice, IMO. Square = Straightforward = Does not do well, sometimes.<br/><b>Subject:</b> 10. Because it''s old and creepy and from the early 19th century. Hahaaah... this rocks.<br/><b>Technical:</b> 6. The highlights are blown-out, but the important details aren''t. You did good, ma''am.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> Spiders, skulls, cobwebs, other creepy stuff. Or your gramma, if she''s still around.<br/><b>Summary:</b> Product shot! Product shot! Product shot! I like it, though. I can just imagine what that gown''s been through...<br/> <br/><b>Disclaimer:</b> <i>The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p</i> <br/></td>', 'From the CTP MkII  First Impression: Product shot!;p If it was, I''d buy one. 6.Composition: 5. It''s pretty square, and square doesn''t do your subject justice, IMO. Square = Straightforward = Does not do well, sometimes.Subject: 10. Because it''s old and creepy and from the early 19th century. Hahaaah... this rocks.Technical: 6. The highlights are blown-out, but the important details aren''t. You did good, ma''am.Improvement: Spiders, skulls, cobwebs, other creepy stuff. Or your gramma, if she''s still around.Summary: Product shot! Product shot! Product shot! I like it, though. I can just imagine what that gown''s been through... Disclaimer: The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p ', '2006-05-11 07:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2405368, 322113, 15711, '<td valign="top">I gotta tell you, I really love this on several levels.  The stark simplicity speaks volumes.  The increasing numbers, going "into oblivion" are not only symbolic, but add some shape to the overall image. The cool blues and greens compliment each other well. The angle of the bulk heads vanishing away from the forefront not only create a great leading line, but their shapes are like steps, giving us numbered spots to rest our eyes.  Superb.<br/> <br/>Why it ranked so low in the ratings is beyond me...</td>', 'I gotta tell you, I really love this on several levels.  The stark simplicity speaks volumes.  The increasing numbers, going "into oblivion" are not only symbolic, but add some shape to the overall image. The cool blues and greens compliment each other well. The angle of the bulk heads vanishing away from the forefront not only create a great leading line, but their shapes are like steps, giving us numbered spots to rest our eyes.  Superb. Why it ranked so low in the ratings is beyond me...', '2006-05-11 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2406206, 322917, 55822, '<td valign="top">Great truck shot with lots of texture. I wouldn''t mind seeing this as a B&amp;W. IMO that would greatly increase the power of the image.</td>', 'Great truck shot with lots of texture. I wouldn''t mind seeing this as a B&W. IMO that would greatly increase the power of the image.', '2006-05-11 14:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
