(2445976, 322588, 36328, '<td valign="top">Thanks Eileen, I think you are one of the few that got what I was aiming for. However, I used PS CS to burn through my adjustment layer to show the bottle green through. <br/> <br/>This turned out to be my lowest rated entry EVER! Ah Well, I''ll try harder next time.</td>', 'Thanks Eileen, I think you are one of the few that got what I was aiming for. However, I used PS CS to burn through my adjustment layer to show the bottle green through.  This turned out to be my lowest rated entry EVER! Ah Well, I''ll try harder next time.', '2006-05-22 09:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
