(2734420, 322882, 48389, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, the angle of the camera is good and the conversion works well but, for me, the roll of film either needs to be fully in the frame or not at all (MHO)</td>', 'This is a great idea, the angle of the camera is good and the conversion works well but, for me, the roll of film either needs to be fully in the frame or not at all (MHO)', '2006-08-16 15:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
