(2742441, 322457, 63949, '<td valign="top">The best part about this picture is that all the greens are on the other side of the tree. This left you a nice spot to get the lighting on that side without the distractions on your side. A great tree with great detailed limbs. A great picture.</td>', 'The best part about this picture is that all the greens are on the other side of the tree. This left you a nice spot to get the lighting on that side without the distractions on your side. A great tree with great detailed limbs. A great picture.', '2006-08-19 21:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
