(4100381, 321863, 69008, '<td valign="top">I used to drive a 54 Ford dump truck. so the front end of this truck looks very familiar.  The truck I drove had the flathead V8 in it. Most of the panel delivery trucks like the one in the image had the straight 6 flatheads, which tended to overheat and crack between the center two valves. I still have an overdrive 3 speed somewhere in my barn from one of these. <br/>That''s a fine shot, and the two subjects compliment each other well. Having the truck away from the house was a good move, as it kept things in porportion in the pic.</td>', 'I used to drive a 54 Ford dump truck. so the front end of this truck looks very familiar.  The truck I drove had the flathead V8 in it. Most of the panel delivery trucks like the one in the image had the straight 6 flatheads, which tended to overheat and crack between the center two valves. I still have an overdrive 3 speed somewhere in my barn from one of these. That''s a fine shot, and the two subjects compliment each other well. Having the truck away from the house was a good move, as it kept things in porportion in the pic.', '2007-09-19 00:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
